    "content": "<h5>Flashpoint</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 10<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 0<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 2 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">When you cast an Art that affects a Sphere or Cube; the size of the affected area is increased by 10ft, and Creatures within 5ft of the center of the Area when the Art is cast have Disadvantage on Saving Throws against that Art.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Caster / Basic Caster Skills</p>",
