    "content": "<h5>Within Reach</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 15<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 10<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 2 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">When you cast an Art that has a range of at least 5 feet, double the range of that Art. Alternatively, if the Art has a range of Touch, that range becomes 30ft instead.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Caster / Basic Caster Skills</p>",
