    "content": "<h5>You Shall Not Pass</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 20<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 10<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You create a wall of fire in a 10 foot cube originating from a point you can see within 60 feet. When a Creature enters the area during its Turn or begins its Turn there, it must make a Dexterity Saving Throw against either your Martial DC or Spell Save DC (your choice). On a failed Save, it takes 2d6 Fire Damage, or 4d6 if it has not lost any Hit Points. On a successful Save, it takes half as much Damage.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Caster / Basic Caster Skills</p>",
    "rawSource": "| You Shall Not Pass\t| 20\t| 10\t| Automatic\t| Action\t| You create a wall of fire in a 10 foot cube originating from a point you can see within 60 feet. When a Creature enters the area during its Turn or begins its Turn there, it must make a Dexterity Saving Throw against either your Martial DC or Spell Save DC (your choice). On a failed Save, it takes 2d6 Fire Damage, or 4d6 if it has not lost any Hit Points. On a successful Save, it takes half as much Damage.\t| 3 Rounds"
