    "content": "<h5>Meandering Stars</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 40<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 30<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> Instant</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">A shower of Arts burst from you, raining like falling stars. Roll 1d6 for each Creature of your choice within 50 feet of you. On a result of 5 or 6, that Creature takes 4d8 Force Damage.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Caster / Advanced Caster Skills</p>",
