      "cost": 40,
      "start": 10,
      "methods": [
        "automatic"
      ],
      "activation": "Action",
      "duration": "Instant",
      "effect": "Choose a location you can see within 100 feet. All Creatures within a 20-foot Sphere centered on that point must make an Intelligence Saving Throw against your Spell Save DC. On a failed Save, they are trapped in your Nightmare until the end of their next Turn; a Creature in the Nightmare takes 2 Psychic Damage for each foot it moves, is Frightened of all other Creatures, and has Disadvantage on all Attacks it makes. A Creature in the Nightmare is not blinded, but the world appears as a horrific facsimile of the real world. On a successful Save, they are Dazed until the end of their next Turn. A Creature that is immune to the Frightened Condition is immune to this effect.",
