    "content": "<h5>Salt the Wound</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 30<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 30<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Reaction<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> Instant</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">When a Creature you can see within 100 feet of you gains a Status Condition as a result of a hostile action, you can use this Skill. The target Creature must make a Constitution Saving Throw against your Spell Save DC, taking 6d6 Necrotic Damage on a failed Save, or half as much on a successful Save.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Caster / Advanced Caster Skills Continued</p>",
