    "content": "<h5>Terrifying Force</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 30<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 20<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> Instant</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You may cast a damaging Art with a Casting Time of Action as part of using this Operator Skill; any hostile Creature that takes Damage from that Art, or is within 10 feet of a Creature that takes Damage from that Art, must succeed on a Wisdom Saving Throw against your Spell Save DC or become Frightened of you until the end of their next Turn.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Caster / Advanced Caster Skills Continued</p>",
