    "content": "<h5>Ultimatum</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 40<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 20<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Offensive<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Once per Turn, after you cast an Art, you release a damaging mote (no Action required) that seeks the hostile Creature with the fewest Hit Points within 60 feet;  make a Ranged Spell Attack against that Creature. On a Hit, that Creature takes 2d10 Force Damage.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Caster / Advanced Caster Skills Continued</p>",
