      "methods": [
        "automatic"
      ],
      "activation": "Bonus Action",
      "duration": "5 Rounds",
      "effect": "Choose a Creature you can see; for the duration, your Arts that target only one Creature ignore the effects of Half Cover, Three Quarter Cover, and Full Cover if they are targeting that Creature. In addition, you no longer require Line of Sight to that Creature to target them with Arts, even if the Art would normally require it, so long as they are within the range.",
