    "content": "<h5>Maximise</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 80<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 30<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> Instant</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">As part of using this Skill, you may cast a Damaging Art. This Turn, when that Art would deal Damage, do not roll; it instead deals the maximum possible Damage for that Art.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Caster / Elite Caster Skills</p>",
