    "content": "<h5>Power Battery</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 80<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 30<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> Instant</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Roll 2d10 and discard one die with the lowest result. You immediately recover that many Arts Points. This allows you to exceed your maximum Arts Points, however, any excess Arts Points are lost when you complete a Long Rest.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Caster / Elite Caster Skills</p>",
