    "content": "<h5>Punishment</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 80<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 35<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 5 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Once on each of your Turns (no Action required), choose a Creature you can see within 60ft. That Creature must make a Dexterity Saving Throw against your Spell Save DC, taking 3d10 Lightning Damage on a failed Save, or half as much on a successful Save.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Caster / Elite Caster Skills</p>",
