    "content": "<h5>Supreme Acuity</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 80<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 20<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> No Action Required<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> Until Long Rest</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">For the duration of this Operator Skill, you may Concentrate on two Arts at the same time. If you fail a Constitution Saving Throw to maintain Concentration, you drop Concentration on one Art; you choose which one.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Caster / Elite Caster Skills Continued</p>",
