    "content": "<h4>1st Level: Versatile Caster</h4>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You are already more versatile than most Casters. You gain the following benefits:</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Additional Arts Pool.</strong> Choose an Arts Pool from the Standard Arts Pools that you have not chosen previously; you learn all of the Arts in that Pool, and they are always Prepared.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Rabbit from the Hat.</strong> As an Action once per Long Rest, you may choose an Art from any Standard Arts Pool. The Art must be of equal or lower Level than your Maximum Art Level. Until you complete a Long Rest, you may cast that Art as if it was part of one of your known Arts Pools.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### 1st Level: Versatile Caster\nYou are already more versatile than most Casters. You gain the following benefits:\n\n**Additional Arts Pool.** Choose an Arts Pool from the Standard Arts Pools that you have not chosen previously; you learn all of the Arts in that Pool, and they are always Prepared.\n\n**Rabbit from the Hat.** As an Action once per Long Rest, you may choose an Art from any Standard Arts Pool. The Art must be of equal or lower Level than your Maximum Art Level. Until you complete a Long Rest, you may cast that Art as if it was part of one of your known Arts Pools.\n\n\n\\column"
