    "rawSource": "#### 6th Level: Empowered Arts\n\nOnce per Turn, when you roll to determine Damage dealt by an Art you cast this Turn, you can cause that Art to deal additional Damage equal to your Proficiency Bonus. If it was a Levelled Art, it also deals additional Damage equal to your Spellcasting Ability Modifier."
