    "rawSource": "#### 1st Level: Chain Art\nWhen you cast an Art that can only affect a single Creature, you can cause that Art to chain to up to two other Creatures within 15 feet of the original Target; these additional Creatures are also considered to be targets of that Art.\n:\nYou can use this Feature a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and regain all expended uses when you complete a Long Rest.\n\n{{note\n##### Arts that can only affect a single Creature\nMany Features in this Branch refer to Arts that only affect a single Creature. For these purposes, this excludes any Art that could do one of the following things to multiple Creatures as a result of being cast once:\n- Deal Damage\n- Restore Hit Points\n- Grant Temporary Hit Points\n- Apply a positive or negative effect\n}}"
