    "content": "<h4>3rd Level: Jury Rigging</h4>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Your drones are so infused with your Arts that their metal can mold like putty in your hands.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">As a Bonus Action, you can use your Arts to enact emergency repairs on one of your Arts Masters; it must be within 100 feet of you, and you must be able to see it. Expend an Amount of Arts Points up to twice your Proficiency Bonus, and roll 1d8 for each AP expended; that Arts Master recovers Hit Points equal to the total amount rolled, and gains any excess healing as Temporary Hit Points.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### 3rd Level: Jury Rigging\n\nYour drones are so infused with your Arts that their metal can mold like putty in your hands.\n:\nAs a Bonus Action, you can use your Arts to enact emergency repairs on one of your Arts Masters; it must be within 100 feet of you, and you must be able to see it. Expend an Amount of Arts Points up to twice your Proficiency Bonus, and roll 1d8 for each AP expended; that Arts Master recovers Hit Points equal to the total amount rolled, and gains any excess healing as Temporary Hit Points."
