    "systemData": {},
    "content": "<h4>6th Level: Synergetic Casting</h4>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You have refined the connection you form with your drones, allowing you to strike as one. You gain the following benefits:</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Arts Translocation.</strong> When you cast an Art, you may cast it as if you were in the space of one of your Arts Master Drones, instead of your own. However, if you do, that Art costs 1 additional Arts Point.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Cantrip Duplication.</strong> Once per Turn, when you cast a Cantrip, you can expend 1 Arts Point to cast that Cantrip again as if you were in the space of one of your Arts Master Drones, targeting the same Creature or area. If you do so, that Arts Master Drone cannot make any Attacks until the beginning of your next Turn.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### 6th Level: Synergetic Casting\nYou have refined the connection you form with your drones, allowing you to strike as one. You gain the following benefits:\n\n**Arts Translocation.** When you cast an Art, you may cast it as if you were in the space of one of your Arts Master Drones, instead of your own. However, if you do, that Art costs 1 additional Arts Point.\n\n**Cantrip Duplication.** Once per Turn, when you cast a Cantrip, you can expend 1 Arts Point to cast that Cantrip again as if you were in the space of one of your Arts Master Drones, targeting the same Creature or area. If you do so, that Arts Master Drone cannot make any Attacks until the beginning of your next Turn.\n\n\\column"
