    "rawSource": "#### 3rd Level: Debilitate and Destroy\nYou excel at crushing enemies who are already reeling from your assault.\n:\nWhen you deal Damage to a Creature that has a negative Status Condition, that Creature loses 1d8 Hit Points. You can only deal this Damage to each Creature once per Turn.\n:\nThis Damage is increased to 2d8 at Level 7, and 3d8 at Level 14.\n\n\\column"
