    "content": "<h4>6th Level: Elemental Burst</h4>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You learn to inflict indirect harm without committing to a larger Art.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">As a Bonus Action during your Turn; choose a point you can see within 100 feet, and a Condition listed in your Residual Suffering Feature. All Creatures within a 20-foot-radius Sphere centred on that point must succeed on a Dexterity Saving Throw against your Spell Save DC or suffer the chosen Condition until the end of your next Turn.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Once you have used this Feature, you must complete a Short Rest before you may do so again.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### 6th Level: Elemental Burst\nYou learn to inflict indirect harm without committing to a larger Art.\n:\nAs a Bonus Action during your Turn; choose a point you can see within 100 feet, and a Condition listed in your Residual Suffering Feature. All Creatures within a 20-foot-radius Sphere centred on that point must succeed on a Dexterity Saving Throw against your Spell Save DC or suffer the chosen Condition until the end of your next Turn.\n:\nOnce you have used this Feature, you must complete a Short Rest before you may do so again.\n\n\n<img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/Nymph.png?de28b4' \n  style='position:absolute;top:300px;right:-230px;width:700px;clip-path:rect(auto auto auto 7%);' />\n\n\n\n\n\n\\page\n{{pageNumber,auto}}\n\n{{wide"
