    "content": "<h4>Hit Points</h4>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Hit Dice:</strong> 1d12 per Defender Level<br><br><strong>Hit Points at 1st Level:</strong> 12 + your Constitution Modifier<br><br><strong>Hit Points at Higher Levels:</strong> 1d12 (or 7) + your Constitution Modifier per Defender Level after 1st</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Hit Points\n**Hit Dice:** 1d12 per Defender Level<br>\n**Hit Points at 1st Level:** 12 + your Constitution Modifier<br>\n**Hit Points at Higher Levels:** 1d12 (or 7) + your Constitution Modifier per Defender Level after 1st"
