    "level": null,
    "systemData": {},
    "content": "<h4>Proficiencies</h4>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Armor:</strong> All Armour, All Shields<br><br><strong>Weapons:</strong> All Melee Weapons<br><br><strong>Tools:</strong> A Tool Kit/Vehicle Proficiency of your Choice<br><br><strong>Saving Throws:</strong> Constitution + one of your choice from the following: Strength, Wisdom<br><br><strong>Skills:</strong> Three from: Athletics, Lore, Tech, Perception, Intimidation, Wilderness</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Proficiencies\n**Armor:** All Armour, All Shields<br>\n**Weapons:** All Melee Weapons<br>\n**Tools:** A Tool Kit/Vehicle Proficiency of your Choice<br>\n**Saving Throws:** Constitution + one of your choice from the following: Strength, Wisdom<br>\n**Skills:** Three from: Athletics, Lore, Tech, Perception, Intimidation, Wilderness\n\n\\column"
