    "content": "<h5>Invariance Principle</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 20<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 15<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Defensive<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 5 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">At the beginning of your Turn, you deal Force Damage to other Creatures within 10 feet equal to your Constitution Modifier.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Defender / Basic Defender Skills</p>",
