    "content": "<h5>Lifestealer</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 15<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 10<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Offensive<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 1 Attack</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Your next Melee Attack deals an additional die of weapon Damage, and you regain Hit Points equal to half of the Damage dealt by that Attack.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Defender / Basic Defender Skills</p>",
