    "content": "<h5>Deterring Radiance</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 40<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 10<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Defensive<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">All Creatures within a 15-foot cube originating from you who can see you  must succeed on a Wisdom Saving Throw against your Martial DC, or be Charmed for the duration. While Charmed, the creature has the Incapacitated Condition and a Speed of 0. A Creature may reattempt this Saving Throw at the end of its Turn, and whenever it takes Damage, ending the Condition on a success.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Defender / Advanced Defender Skills</p>",
