    "content": "<h5>Halting Feather</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 35<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 5<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Offensive<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">For the duration of this Operator Skill, each time you hit a Creature with an Attack, you sap their motion, reducing their Speed by 10 feet until the end of their next Turn. If you reduce a Creature’s Speed to 0 while this Skill is active, that Creature take 4d6 Force Damage.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Defender / Advanced Defender Skills</p>",
