    "content": "<h5>Shell Defence</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 30<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 20<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Defensive<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Your Speed becomes 0 and cannot be increased. However, whenever you take Damage from a Creature, you only take half of that Damage. You can end this Operator Skill early during your Turn (no Action required).</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Defender / Advanced Defender Skills</p>",
