      "activation": "Action",
      "duration": "5 Rounds",
      "effect": "You summon a Light of Hope in a location you can see. The Light is intangible, cannot be damaged or moved, and projects bright light in a 30-foot radius around it. For the duration of the Skill, Friendly Creatures within 15-foot of the Light have Advantage on Wisdom and Charisma Saving Throws, and gain Temporary Hit Points at the beginning of each of their Turns equal to your Character Level. Once per Turn, when you hit a Creature with an Attack while you are within 15-feet of a Light of Hope, that Creature loses 1d8 Hit Points.",
