    "content": "<h5>Oath</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 80<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 40<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Defensive<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 4 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You may activate this Operator Skill even if you would be prevented from taking an Action. You may remove any Status Conditions or effects affecting you, and you gain Temporary Hit Points equal to your Wisdom Modifier multiplied by ten (minimum of 10). While you have this Temporary Hit Points, you take half Damage from all sources. These Temporary Hit Points are removed when the Skill ends.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Defender / Elite Defender Skills</p>",
