    "content": "<h5>Rolling Stone</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 65<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 30<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 5 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You cannot make any Attacks until the end of your next Turn after activating this Skill. Additionally, until the end of your next Turn, ground within 15 feet of you is considered to be Difficult Terrain for hostile Creatures. From the end of your next Turn until the end of this Skill's duration, you may make an additional Attack when you take the Attack Action, and you may target an additional Creature with each Melee Attack.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Defender / Elite Defender Skills</p>",
