    "rawSource": "#### 1st Level: Against the Storm\nYou develop tactics for countering Arts Users, resisting their powers and employing their own strength against them. You gain the following benefits:\n\n**Arts Resistance.** You have Advantage on Saving Throws made against Arts.\n\n**Spellshield.** Creatures benefitting from your Shelter Feature have Advantage on Saving Throws against Arts you can see. Additionally, if a Creature benefitting from your Shelter Feature would take half Damage as a result of succeeding on a Saving Throw against an Art you can see, you can expend 2 Resilience (no Action required) to cause them to take no damage from that Art instead.\n\n\n{{imageMaskEdge1,--offset:2%,--rotation:90\n<img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/thumb/5/57/Dur-nar_Elite_2.png/1024px-Dur-nar_Elite_2.png?4c733c' \n  style='position:absolute;top:395px;right:0px;width:1100px;clip-path:rect(8% auto 91% auto);' />\n}}\n\n{{imageMaskEdge1,--offset:23%,--rotation:0\n<img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/thumb/5/57/Dur-nar_Elite_2.png/1024px-Dur-nar_Elite_2.png?4c733c' \n  style='position:absolute;top:395px;right:0px;width:1100px;clip-path:rect(8% auto 91% auto);' />\n}}\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\\column"
