    "rawSource": "#### 4th Level: Weapons of the Enemy\nYou have all but made the weapons of your enemy into your own. You gain the following benefits:\n\n**Arts Absorption.** When you take Arts Damage, you may absorb some of the energy from that Art (no Action required). After you have absorbed energy in this way, you may expel it as an Action during your Turn. All Creatures within a 10ft Square originating from you must make a Dexterity Saving Throw against your Martial DC. On a failed Save, they take 3d6 Force Damage; on a successful Save, they take half as much Damage. \n:\nThis Damage is increased to 6d6 at Level 7, and 9d6 at Level 14.\n\n**Empowered Strikes.** Your Melee Weapon Attacks deal an additional 1d6 Force Damage. While you have an active Operator Skill, your Melee Weapon Attacks instead deal an additional 2d6 Force Damage."
