    "rawSource": "#### 12th Level: Stormchaser\nYour enduring enmity of enemy Casters leads you to the forefront, an elemental hell few but you can endure. You intend to change that. You gain the following benefits:\n\n**Improved Arts Resistance.** You always have DR against Arts Damage equal to half of your DR against Physical Damage, rounding up.\n\n**Leaping Ward.** You can now use your Leaping Defence Feature when a Creature within a distance equal to half your Speed would make a Saving Throw against an Art or Art-like effects. If you do so, both you and that allied Creature are considered to be Resistant to the Damage dealt by that Art this Turn.\n\n\\page\n{{pageNumber,auto}}"
