    "rawSource": "#### 1st Level: Guardian of Life\nYou can cast Arts; the information below details how you use those rules as a Guardian.\n:\n***Arts Points:*** The Guardian Arts Casting table shows how many Arts Points you have to cast your Level 1+ Arts. You regain all expended Arts Points when you finish a Long Rest. \n:\n***Maximum Arts Level:*** The Guardian Arts Casting table shows the maximum Level you can cast an Art at, based on your Defender Level.\n:\n***Spellcasting Ability:*** When you gain this Feature, choose either Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma; that is your Spellcasting Ability.\n:\n***Spellcasting Focus:*** Shields equipped by you gain the Casting Unit Property for the duration.\n\n{{classTable,frame,decoration\n##### Guardian Arts Casting\n| Level | Maximum Art Level | Arts Points |\n|:-----:|:-----------------:|:-----------:|\n| 1st   |         1         |      3      |\n| 2nd   |         1         |      3      |\n| 3rd   |         1         |      4      |\n| 4th   |         1         |      4      |\n| 5th   |         2         |      6      |\n| 6th   |         2         |      6      |\n| 7th   |         2         |      7      |\n| 8th   |         2         |      7      |\n| 9th   |         3         |      10     |\n| 10th  |         3         |      10     |\n| 11th  |         3         |      11      |\n| 12th  |         3         |      11      |\n| 13th  |         4         |      12     |\n| 14th  |         4         |      12     |\n| 15th  |         4         |      15     |\n| 16th  |         4         |      15     |\n| 17th  |         5         |      16     |\n| 18th  |         5         |      16     |\n| 19th  |         5         |      17     |\n| 20th  |         5         |      17     |\n\n}}\n\n***Guardian Arts Pool:*** When you gain this Feature, you learn all of the Arts from the Healing Arts Special Arts Pool of 5th Level or less, including all Cantrips in that Pool. These Arts are always prepared.\n\n\\column"
