    "sourceHeading": "15th Level: The Best Medicine",
    "itemType": "feat",
    "level": 15,
    "systemData": {},
    "content": "<h4>15th Level: The Best Medicine</h4>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You may have dedicated a part of yourself to the healing of others, but you are still a frontline fighter; woe betide those who forget that.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You can activate this Feature as a Bonus Action. For the next minute, whenever you make a Melee Attack against a Creature, you may restore 2d6 Hit Points to a Creature of your choice that you can see within 30 feet.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Once you have used this Feature, you may not do so again until you complete a Long Rest.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### 15th Level: The Best Medicine\nYou may have dedicated a part of yourself to the healing of others, but you are still a frontline fighter; woe betide those who forget that. \n:\nYou can activate this Feature as a Bonus Action. For the next minute, whenever you make a Melee Attack against a Creature, you may restore 2d6 Hit Points to a Creature of your choice that you can see within 30 feet. \n:\nOnce you have used this Feature, you may not do so again until you complete a Long Rest.\n\n{{imageMaskEdge8,--offset:4%,--rotation:270\n<img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/c/ca/Nearl_Elite_2.png?2a824c&20230926225639' \n  style='position:absolute;top:-200px;right:-400px;width:1300px' />\n}}\n\n{{imageMaskEdge8,--offset:5%,--rotation:0\n<img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/c/ca/Nearl_Elite_2.png?2a824c&20230926225639' \n  style='position:absolute;top:-200px;right:-400px;width:1300px' />\n}}\n\n\n\\page\n{{pageNumber,auto}}"
