    "rawSource": "#### 1st Level: Superheavy\nWhile you are wearing Heavy Armour, you have an Arts Barrier surrounding your person. When you would take Damage from another Creature, a layer of the Barrier shatters, halving that instance of Damage. You may reform a layer of the Barrier as an Action during your Turn, or as a Bonus Action by expending 1 Resilience.\n:\nThe maximum layers of Barrier you can have is 1. This maximum is increased to 2 at 7th Level, and 3 at 14th Level.\n\n<img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/a/a4/Mudrock.png?95b848&20230927012624' \n  style='position:absolute;top:360px;right:270px;width:600px' />\n\n\\column"
