    "content": "<h4>1st Level: Centre of Attention</h4>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">As an Action, or as a Bonus Action if you expend 2 Resilience, Creatures of your choice within 10 feet of you must succeed on a Wisdom Saving Throw against your Protector DC, or be Taunted by you until the end of their next Turn. A Taunted Creature must Attack you during its Turn, if it is able to.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You can use this Feature a number of times equal to your Constitution Modifier, and regain all expended uses upon finishing a Long Rest.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### 1st Level: Centre of Attention\nAs an Action, or as a Bonus Action if you expend 2 Resilience, Creatures of your choice within 10 feet of you must succeed on a Wisdom Saving Throw against your Protector DC, or be Taunted by you until the end of their next Turn. A Taunted Creature must Attack you during its Turn, if it is able to.\n:\nYou can use this Feature a number of times equal to your Constitution Modifier, and regain all expended uses upon finishing a Long Rest."
