    "rawSource": "#### 1st Level: Pavise\nEstablish a forward position, attack, move, repeat. These are the Sentries's lessons.\n\n**Additional Weapon Proficiencies.** You gain Proficiency with Light Ranged Weapons and Heavy Ranged Weapons.\n\n**Plant Pavise.** As a Bonus Action while you have a Heavy Shield equipped, you can plant your shield in the ground. Allied Creatures, including you, within 10 feet of your planted shield gain the benefit of your Shelter Action, so long as the attack originates from the opposite side of the shield from that Creature's perspective. Additionally, your planted shield functions as Half Cover.\n\nYou can recover your shield as an Interact with Object while you are within 5 feet of it, and you can only have one shield planted at a time. Other Creatures cannot move your planted Shield."
