    "content": "<h4>4th Level: Marksman Training</h4>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You learn to better blend your identity as a ranged Defender, creating a potent hybrid.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Operator Skill Access.</strong> Whenever you gain a new Operator Skill, you may instead choose a Skill from the appropriate Operator Skills table available to the Marksman Class.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Additional Fighting Style.</strong> You gain a Fighting Style from one of the options available to the Marksman Class.</p>",
