    "rawSource": "#### 15th Level: Firebase\nNone cross your field of fire unharmed. You gain the following benefits:\n\n**Retributor.** Once per Round, you may use your Advance and Fire Feature without expending use of your Reaction.\n\n**Torrent of Lead, Wall of Steel.** Once per Long Rest, you may activate this Feature during your Turn (no Action required). Until the end of your next Turn, when you make a Ranged Attack as a result of your Advance and Fire Feature, you can make an additional Attack (no Action required) against the same Creature; these Attacks cannot generate further Attacks.\n\n{{imageMaskEdge1,--offset:2%,--rotation:270\n<img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/d/d8/Underflow.png?d17df1&20240605104759' \n  style='position:absolute;top:560px;right:-120px;width:650px' />\n}}\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\\page"
