    "rawSource": "#### Hit Points\n**Hit Dice:** 1d10 per Guard Level<br>\n**Hit Points at 1st Level:** 10 + your Constitution Modifier<br>\n**Hit Points at Higher Levels:** 1d10 (or 6) + your Constitution Modifier per Guard Level after 1st"
