    "rawSource": "#### Proficiencies\n**Armor:** Light Armour, Medium Armour, Light Shields<br>\n**Weapons:** All Melee Weapons<br>\n**Tools:** Maintenance Kit<br>\n**Saving Throws:** Strength + one of your choice from the following: Constitution, Dexterity<br>\n**Skills:** Three from: Acrobatics, Athletics, Lore, Insight, Intimidation, Wilderness"
