    "itemType": "feat",
    "level": null,
    "systemData": {},
    "content": "<h4>Equipment</h4>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You start with the following Equipment, in addition to any Equipment granted by your Background.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">• <strong>A)</strong> 1x Heavy Melee Weapon OR <strong>B)</strong> 1x Light Melee Weapon</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">• <strong>A)</strong> 1x Light Melee Weapon OR <strong>B)</strong> 1x Light Shield</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">• <strong>A)</strong> Reinforced Outfit OR <strong>B)</strong> Combat Gear</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">• One Kit you are Proficient with.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">OR</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">• 1300 LMD</p>\n<h5>The Guard</h5>\n<div class=\"ak5e-source-table-wrap\"><table class=\"ak5e-source-table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Level</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Proficiency Bonus</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Features</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">1st</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">+2</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Elite 0- Guard Branch, Fighting Style, Push the Advantage</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">2nd</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">+2</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Basic Operator Skill</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">3rd</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">+2</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Basic Talent, Unrelenting</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">4th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">+2</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Ability Score Improvement, Branch Feature</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">5th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">+3</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Extra Attack</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">6th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">+3</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Ability Score Improvement</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">7th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">+3</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Elite 1- Advanced Operator Skill</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">8th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">+3</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Ability Score Improvement, Basic Talent Module</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">9th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">+4</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Advanced Talent</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">10th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">+4</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Ability Score Improvement, Branch Feature</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">11th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">+4</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Unrelenting Upgraded</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">12th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">+4</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Ability Score Improvement</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">13th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">+5</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Advanced Talent Module, Branch Feature</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">14th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">+5</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Elite 2- Elite Operator Skill</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">15th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">+5</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Unrelenting Aggression</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">16th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">+5</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Ability Score Improvement</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">17th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">+6</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Branch Feature</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">18th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">+6</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Eternal Aggression</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">19th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">+6</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Ability Score Improvement</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">20th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">+6</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Annihilation Protocol</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
    "rawSource": "#### Equipment\nYou start with the following Equipment, in addition to any Equipment granted by your Background. \n\n- **A)** 1x Heavy Melee Weapon OR **B)** 1x Light Melee Weapon\n- **A)** 1x Light Melee Weapon OR **B)** 1x Light Shield\n- **A)** Reinforced Outfit OR **B)** Combat Gear\n- One Kit you are Proficient with.\n\nOR\n\n- 1300 LMD\n\n\n{{classTable,frame,decoration,wide\n##### The Guard\n| Level | Proficiency Bonus | Features |    \n|:-----:|:-----------------:|:--------:|\n|  1st  |  +2  | Elite 0- Guard Branch, Fighting Style, Push the Advantage |\n|  2nd  |  +2  | Basic Operator Skill  |\n|  3rd  |  +2  | Basic Talent, Unrelenting  |\n|  4th  |  +2  | Ability Score Improvement, Branch Feature  |\n|  5th  |  +3  | Extra Attack |\n|  6th  |  +3  | Ability Score Improvement  |\n|  7th  |  +3  | Elite 1- Advanced Operator Skill  |\n|  8th  |  +3  | Ability Score Improvement, Basic Talent Module  |\n|  9th  |  +4  | Advanced Talent    |\n| 10th  |  +4  | Ability Score Improvement, Branch Feature   |\n| 11th  |  +4  | Unrelenting Upgraded     |\n| 12th  |  +4  | Ability Score Improvement      |\n| 13th  |  +5  | Advanced Talent Module, Branch Feature      |\n| 14th  |  +5  | Elite 2- Elite Operator Skill  |\n| 15th  |  +5  | Unrelenting Aggression |\n| 16th  |  +5  | Ability Score Improvement    |\n| 17th  |  +6  | Branch Feature   |\n| 18th  |  +6  | Eternal Aggression      |\n| 19th  |  +6  | Ability Score Improvement        |\n| 20th  |  +6  | Annihilation Protocol      |\n}}\n\n{{pageNumber,auto}}\n\n\\page"
