    "content": "<h5>Blade’s Reach</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 10<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 5<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 4 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Your Reach is increased by 5 feet for the duration. Additionally, before or after you make a Melee Attack, you can move up to 5 feet (no Action required). Additionally, when a Creature enters your Reach, you may make a Melee Attack against them as a Reaction.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Guard / Basic Guard Skills</p>",
