    "content": "<h5>Evasive Stance</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 10<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 5<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Defensive<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Reaction<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Your Armour Class is increased by a value equal to your Proficiency Bonus.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Guard / Basic Guard Skills</p>",
