    "content": "<h5>Mark Prey</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 15<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 15<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Choose a Creature that you can see; the first time each Turn that Creature is hit by an Attack, it takes 1d4 additional Damage. A Creature cannot be affected by more than one Mark Prey at a time.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Guard / Basic Guard Skills</p>",
