    "content": "<h5>Frost Claw</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 40<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 10<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Offensive<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">When you use this Skill, and as an Action on subsequent Turns for the duration, you release a cutting blast of ice-cold Arts energy in a 30-ft long, 5-ft wide line. All Creatures within the line must make a Dexterity Saving Throw against your Martial DC, taking 4d6 Cold Damage on a failed Save, or half as much on a successful Save.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Guard / Advanced Guard Skills</p>",
