    "content": "<h5>Half Sword Stance</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 40<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 0<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Offensive<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You adopt a specialised stance designed to exploit weaknesses in the enemies' defence, at the cost of your own defence. Your Melee Attacks ignore Resistance and Damage Reduction against Physical Damage. Additionally, if you hit a Creature with a Melee Attack that would be Resistant or have Damage Reduction against that Attack, that Attack deals additional Damage equal to half of your Character Level. However, for the duration, Attack Rolls against you are made at Advantage.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Guard / Advanced Guard Skills</p>",
