    "content": "<h5>Night-Splitting Light</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 50<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 20<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">One melee weapon of your choice that you are wielding is empowered with radiant light. For the duration, its Damage is converted to Radiant Damage, you have an additional 5 feet of Reach on Attacks using that Weapon, and when you take the Attack Action, you may make an additional Attack with that weapon as part of that Action. This Operator Skill ends early if you are no longer wielding that weapon.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Guard / Advanced Guard Skills Continued</p>",
