    "content": "<h5>Ready Stance</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 30<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 20<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Assume a stance ready for countering. While in this stance, when a Creature you can see hits you with an Attack, you can use your Reaction to halve the Damage of that Attack, and make a Melee Attack against them if they are within your Reach. If that Attack hits, you regain use of your Reaction.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Guard / Advanced Guard Skills Continued</p>",
