    "content": "<h5>Sweeping Stance</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 35<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 15<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Offensive<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 2 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">When you hit with a Melee Attack against a Creature during your Turn, you can deal Damage to a different Creature within your Reach equal to the Ability Modifier used for the Attack (no Action required). The Damage Type is the same as one on the original Attack (your choice).</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Guard / Advanced Guard Skills Continued</p>",
