    "content": "<h5>Thorn Counter</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 30<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 10<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Defensive<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You gain DR against Physical Damage equal to your Proficiency Bonus. You have Disadvantage on all Attack Rolls, but any Creature that makes a Melee Attack against you or hits you with a Melee Attack takes 2d8 Poison Damage after the Attack. A Creature can only take this Damage once per Attack.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Guard / Advanced Guard Skills Continued</p>",
