    "content": "<h5>Vacuum Assault</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 40<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 15<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Once per Turn when you make an Attack Roll, you can force all hostile Creatures within 30 feet of you to make a Strength Saving Throw against your Martial DC. On a failed Save, they are pulled 20 feet towards you; on a successful Save, they are only pulled 10 feet towards you. If a Creature would enter your space as a result of this movement, they are placed as close to you as possible, and take 2d8 Bludgeoning Damage.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Guard / Advanced Guard Skills Continued</p>",
