    "content": "<h5>Wave Strike</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 50<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 20<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> Instant</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">With a powerful swing, you send forth a powerful blast of wind. Each Creature in a 30ft Cone originating from you must make a Strength Saving Throw against your Martial DC, taking 4d6 Thunder Damage and being pushed 30 feet away from you on a failed Save. On a successful Save, they take half as much Damage, and are not knocked away. If a Creature collides with a wall or similar surface when being knocked back by this Operator Skill, they take 4d6 Bludgeoning Damage.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Guard / Advanced Guard Skills Continued</p>",
