    "content": "<h5>Blood Boil</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 50<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 30<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">For the duration, your Attacks deal 1d12 additional Weapon Damage, but you take 1d12 Fire Damage at the end of each Turn that cannot be reduced by Resistances or Damage Reduction. While this Skill is Active, keep track of the amount of Damage you take; when this Skill ends, all other Creatures within a 15-foot-radius Sphere centered on you must make a Dexterity Saving Throw against your Martial DC. On a failed Save, they take Fire Damage equal to twice the Damage you took while this Skill was Active; on a successful Save, they take half as much. You can end this Operator Skill early as a Bonus Action.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Guard / Elite Guard Skills</p>",
