    "content": "<h5>Flash of Lightning</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 80<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 40<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Offensive<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> Instant</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You disappear in a flash of thunder, leaving only defeated foes in the aftermath. Choose up to five Creatures you can see within 60 feet; you immediately make a Melee Attack against each of those Creatures as if they were in your Reach. On a hit, the Attack deals 1 additional die of Damage, and the Damage of that Attack is converted to Lightning Damage. In addition, other hostile Creatures within 10 feet of the Creature you hit must make a Dexterity Saving Throw against your Martial DC, taking 4d6 Thunder Damage on a failed Save, or half as much on a successful Save.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Guard / Elite Guard Skills</p>",
