    "content": "<h5>Meteoric Descent</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 65<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 30<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> Instant</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You cannot make, or have made, any Attacks the Turn you Activate this Operator Skill. Choose a location you can see within 300-feet. You raise 30-feet into the air and hover there; for the remainder of the Turn, your Speed becomes 0. At the beginning of your next Turn, you appear at the chosen location with thunderous impact; all other Creatures within 20-feet of that location must make a Dexterity Saving Throw against your Martial DC. On a failed Save, they take 14d6 Thunder Damage; on a successful Save, they take half as much Damage.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Guard / Elite Guard Skills Continued</p>",
