    "content": "<h5>Thousand Cuts</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 65<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 30<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Offensive<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 2 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">For the duration, you manifest a storm of slashes in a 15-foot-radius Sphere that is always centred on you. When a Creature (except you) enters the area or begins its Turn there, it takes 3d10 Slashing Damage. You may extend the duration of this Skill by 1 Round by expending your Action, up to a maximum of 5 Rounds.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Guard / Elite Guard Skills Continued</p>",
