    "content": "<h4>17th Level: Mountainbreaker</h4>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You unleash your furore in such a concentrated assault that few foes can hope to withstand it.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">As an Action, you may either;</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">• Make an Unarmed Strike against a Creature within your Reach. If it hits, you may make another Unarmed Strike against it, and so on, until you miss or have made 10 Attacks; at which point the sequence ends. Each Attack after the first suffers a cumulative -2 to hit.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">• Make an Unarmed Strike against a Creature within your Reach; if it hits, the Damage of that Attack is multiplied by five. Additionally, if the Creature is no more than one size larger than you, they are knocked 20 feet directly away from you and fall Prone.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Once you use this Feature, you must complete a Long Rest before you may do so again.</p>",
