    "rawSource": "#### 4th Level: Foecrusher\n\nWhenever you make a Melee Attack, you can choose to make that Attack a Foecrusher. A Foecrusher has one of the following effects (your Choice):\n\n**Staggering Strike.** A Creature hit by this Attack has its Speed halved until the end of its next Turn.\n\n**Dazing Strike.** A Creature hit by this Attack has the Dazed Condition until the end of their next Turn.\n\n**Renewing Strike.** If you hit with this Attack, you may expend and roll one of your Hit Dice, and recover Hit Points equal to the amount rolled plus your Constitution Modifier. \n\n**Smashing Strike.** A Creature that takes Damage from this Attack is pushed 15 feet away from you; you may then move up to half your Speed directly towards that Creature without provoking Opportunity Attacks.\n:\nYou may use this Feature a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and regain all expended uses whenever you finish a Short Rest.\n:\n**Press the Attack: Overbear (2 Aggression)** You may use this Press the Attack option when you make an Attack a Foecrusher (no Action required); that Attack deals 1d10 additional Damage, and you may choose a second Foecrusher Effect to apply to that Attack without expending a use of that Feature. You must choose a different Effect than the original.\n\n<img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/1/12/Hoederer.png' \n  style='position:absolute;top:80px;right:-10px;width:400px' />\n\n{{pageNumber,auto}}\n\n\\page"
