    "content": "<h4>13th Level: Smouldering Anger</h4>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You gain the following benefits:</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Cannot be Denied.</strong> The additional Damage from your Flash of Anger Feature is now Force Damage. If you have an Operator Skill that deals an Arts Damage Type, you can cause your Flash of Anger Feature to deal that Damage Type instead of Force when you use it.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Caught in the Crossfire.</strong> When you use your Flash of Anger Feature, you can choose a different Creature within 10 feet of the Creature you attacked; that Creature also takes the additional Damage dealt by your Flash of Anger Feature to the original Creature.</p>",
