    "content": "<h5>Defender of the Worthy</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 15<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 0<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">When you activate this Operator Skill, you gain 1d8 Temporary Hit Points for each Liberty you consumed this Turn. While this Skill is Active, when a Creature within 15 feet of you is attacked, you may move to them and replace them as the target of the Attack as a Reaction. If you still have Temporary Hit Points after the Attack, you regain your Reaction, and can make a Melee Attack against the attacking Creature.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Guard: Liberator / Liberator Basic Skills</p>",
    "rawSource": "|Defender of the Worthy| 15  | 0 |Automatic|Action|When you activate this Operator Skill, you gain 1d8 Temporary Hit Points for each Liberty you consumed this Turn. While this Skill is Active, when a Creature within 15 feet of you is attacked, you may move to them and replace them as the target of the Attack as a Reaction. If you still have Temporary Hit Points after the Attack, you regain your Reaction, and can make a Melee Attack against the attacking Creature.|3 Rounds|"
