      "tier": "Advanced",
      "cost": 40,
      "start": 15,
      "methods": [
        "automatic"
      ],
      "activation": "Bonus Action",
      "duration": "3 Rounds",
      "effect": "Your Arts coalesce into a spectral floating weapon within a space you can see with 100 feet. When you activate this Opeartor Skill, and as a Bonus Action on subsequent Turns, you can cause the weapon to move up to 20 feet in a direction of your choice, and make a Melee Attack using the weapon against a target within 5 feet of it; you can use your Dexerity Modifier instead of Strength for the Attack and Damage Rolls, and you are considered to be Proficient with it. On a hit, the weapon deals 2d10 + your Ability Modifier Force Damage. The Critical Range of Attacks with this Weapon is increased by 1.",
