    "content": "<h5>Glory</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 80<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 30<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">When you Activate this Skill, and as an Action on each of your subsequent Turns; all Creatures within a 60-foot cone originating from you must make a Dexterity Saving Throw against your Martial DC. On a failed save, they take 5d12 Radiant Damage, or half as much on a successful one.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Guard: Liberator / Liberator Elite Skills</p>",
