    "rawSource": "#### 1st Level: Tenacity\nThe closer to death you are, the harder you fight. You gain the following benefits:\n\n**Nothing to Lose.** If you have equal to or less than 50% of your maximum Hit Points remaining, you can make a Melee Weapon Attack as a Bonus Action. If you have equal to or less than 10% of your maximum Hit Points remaining, you can instead make two Melee Weapon Attacks as part of this Bonus Action. \n\n**Soloblade.** When you hit a Creature with a Melee Attack, you can recover 2d6 Hit Points. This amount increases to 2d8 at 7th Level, and 2d10 at 14th Level.\n\n**Stand Alone.** When another Creature would restore Hit Points to you, you instead gain Temporary Hit Points equal to the Hit Points you would have recovered.\n\n\\column"
