    "content": "<h5>Reaper and Hordes</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Reaper is a Branch that cares about killing hostile Creatures perhaps more than any other. As such, the reccomendation for Reaper interacting with Swarm is that the max Hit Points of the Creature that comprises the Swarm is considered the Threshold for earning \"kills\". If they deal more than this Threshold in a single instance of Damage, they have \"killed\" 1 Creature; if that instance is double that Threshold, they have \"killed\" 2 Creatures, and so on.</p>",
    "rawSource": "##### Reaper and Hordes\nReaper is a Branch that cares about killing hostile Creatures perhaps more than any other. As such, the reccomendation for Reaper interacting with Swarm is that the max Hit Points of the Creature that comprises the Swarm is considered the Threshold for earning \"kills\". If they deal more than this Threshold in a single instance of Damage, they have \"killed\" 1 Creature; if that instance is double that Threshold, they have \"killed\" 2 Creatures, and so on.\n}}\n\n\n\n\\column"
