    "rawSource": "#### 4th Level: Judgement Cut\nWhen you hit a Creature with a Melee Attack, you can mark them for Judgement Cut as a Bonus Action. Judgement Cut ends at the end of your second Turn after activating this Feature, or until when you end it early during your Turn by stowing a Weapon. For the duration, keep track of the total Weapon Damage you deal to that Creature; when the Mark ends or is ended by you, that Creature takes Slashing Damage equal to half of the total Weapon Damage they received from you in that time.\n:\nOnce you have used this Feature, you may not do so again until you complete a Short or Long Rest."
