    "rawSource": "#### 17th Level: Song of Steel\nThe cacophony of war and battle flows through you; every sinew feels its vibrations, and sings its song. All you need to do is unleash it.\n:\nYou may use this Feature as a Bonus Action; for the next minute, your Weapon Attacks have +1 Critical Range, and on a Critical Hit, you ignore any Damage Resistance that Creature has to Physical Damage. Additionally, Attacks with your Signature Weapon are made at Advantage for the duration.\n:\nOnce you have used this Feature, you may not do so again until you complete a Long Rest.\n\n}}\n\n{{imageMaskEdge1,--offset:12%,--rotation:0\n <img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/8/8c/Degenbrecher_Elite_2.png?20231205044332' \n  style='position:absolute;top:300px;right:-210px;width:1300px' />\n}}\n\n\n\\page"
