    "content": "<h5>Hidden Might</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 10<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 5<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Offensive<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 1 Round</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Your Ability Modifier is doubled for your Attack Rolls.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Marksman / Basic Marksman Skills</p>",
