    "content": "<h5>Overpacked Charges</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 15<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 5<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Offensive<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 2 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">For the duration, the size of any effect created by you that affects a Sphere, Cube, Cylinder, or Cone is increased by 10 feet. Additionally, If these effects involve a Saving Throw, the DC of that Saving Throw is increased by 1.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Marksman / Basic Marksman Skills</p>",
