    "content": "<h5>Armour-Piercer</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 20<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 10<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> Instant</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Make a Weapon Attack as part of this Action. If it hits a Creature that has any Physical DR, the value of that DR is halved, rounding down, until the end of your next Turn.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Marksman / Advanced Marksman Skills</p>",
