    "content": "<h5>Saturation Fire</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 40<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 10<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Offensive<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">When you take the Attack Action, you may choose to make 2 additional Ranged Attacks as part of that Action. If you do, all of your Attacks made as part of that Action are made at Disadvantage.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Marksman / Advanced Marksman Skills Continued</p>",
