    "content": "<h5>Search and Destroy</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 30<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 10<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">For the duration, your passive Perception is increased by 5, your Movement Speed increases by 20ft, and your Attacks deal 1d8 additional Damage to Creatures below their Hit Point Maximum.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Marksman / Advanced Marksman Skills Continued</p>",
