    "content": "<h5>Self-Defence Shock</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 20<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 20<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Defensive<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> Instant</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Choose a Creature you can see within 10 feet; target Creature must make a Constitution Saving Throw against your Martial DC. On a failed Save, they are Stunned until the end of their next Turn. On a successful Save, their Movement Speed is halved until the end of their next Turn.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Marksman / Advanced Marksman Skills Continued</p>",
