    "content": "<h5>Spinning Edge</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 35<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 15<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You can only use this Operator Skill while you are wielding a weapon with the Thrown Property; you throw the Weapon to a location within that Weapon's normal range where it spins violently. For the duration, when a Creature begins its Turn within 15 feet of the location, or moves within 15 feet during its Turn, they must make a Dexterity Saving Throw against your Martial DC. On a failed Save, they take Slashing Damage equal to 5d4 + the Weapon's base Damage. On a successful Save, they take half as much Damage. When this Operator Skill ends, the weapon falls to the floor at that location.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Marksman / Advanced Marksman Skills Continued</p>",
    "rawSource": "| Spinning Edge\t| 35\t| 15\t| Automatic\t| Action\t| You can only use this Operator Skill while you are wielding a weapon with the Thrown Property; you throw the Weapon to a location within that Weapon's normal range where it spins violently. For the duration, when a Creature begins its Turn within 15 feet of the location, or moves within 15 feet during its Turn, they must make a Dexterity Saving Throw against your Martial DC. On a failed Save, they take Slashing Damage equal to 5d4 + the Weapon's base Damage. On a successful Save, they take half as much Damage. When this Operator Skill ends, the weapon falls to the floor at that location.\t| 3 Rounds"
