    "content": "<h5>Continental Style</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 40<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 30<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 5 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You do not have Disadvantage on Ranged Attack Rolls when there is a hostile Creature within 5 feet of you. Additionally, for each Ranged Attack you make during a Turn, you may make a single Melee Attack during that Turn (no Action required); a Creature that you have made a Melee Attack against cannot make Opportunity Attacks against you for the remainder of the Turn. However, you can only make one Melee Attack per Turn in this way against each Creature.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Marksman / Elite Marksman Skills</p>",
