    "content": "<h5>Eternal Hunt</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 65<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 30<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 2 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Choose a Creature you can see within 100 feet. For the duration of the Skill, you can only target that Creature with Attacks. However, your Attacks against it ignore the benefits of Half and Three-Quarters Cover, and deal additional Weapon Damage equal to half of your Character Level.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Marksman / Elite Marksman Skills</p>",
