    "content": "<h5>Inexorable</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 80<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 35<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Offensive<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Your missed Attacks still deal half of their Damage to their intended target(s). Furthermore, if a Creature would take half Damage as a result of passing a Saving Throw imposed by you, they still take the full Damage.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Marksman / Elite Marksman Skills</p>",
