    "content": "<h5>No Escape</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 65<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 30<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 2 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">When you make a Ranged Attack, it now targets a point within the Normal Range of that Attack. All Creatures within a 5-foot-wide line from the origin of the Attack to the chosen point are considered targets for the Attack; you make one Attack Roll, but check the result against the Armour Class of all targets seperately. In addition, these Attacks are capable of travelling through up to 5 feet of solid material, allowing them to pierce total Cover, and negating any benefits of Half or Three Quarters Cover.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Marksman / Elite Marksman Skills</p>",
