    "content": "<h5>The Hunt is On</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 35<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 35<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Reaction<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> Instant</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You may Activate this Skill as a Reaction after Initiative has been rolled; you may immediately take a full Turn before any other Creature takes theirs. Then, you take your rolled place in the Initiative Order and continue as normal.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Marksman / Elite Marksman Skills</p>",
