    "rawSource": "#### 1st Level: Air Tracking\nYou are already well versed in tracking fast moving aerial targets. You gain the following benefits:\n\n**Pigeon Shooting.** Your Ranged Attacks against Creatures that are not in contact with the ground, or moved 60 or more feet during their last Turn, are made at Advantage. \n\n**Shifting Focus.** If your Target is reduced to 0 Hit Points, you can use a Bonus Action during your Turn to choose a new hostile Creature to be your Target for the remainder of the duration.\n\n{{imageMaskCorner29,--offsetX:-53%,--offsetY:-60%,--rotation:0\n<img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/Meteor_Elite_2.png?f157c4' \n  style='position:absolute;top:400px;right:150px;width:800px' />\n}}\n\n\n\n\n\\column"
