    "rawSource": "#### 1st Level: Delayed Detonation\nExplosives aren't all about the heat of the moment.\n:\nOnce per Short Rest, when you would use a weapon with the Splash (X) Property during an Attack, you can instead choose to fire a specially fused munition at a grounded point you can see within the range of that weapon, where it burrows into the ground and becomes invisible. As a Reaction to a Creature moving, you can detonate that munition; resolve an Attack with the weapon you used on the point you chose, as per the Splash (X) Property. If you do not manually detonate it, it detonates automatically after 10 minutes unless you disarm it as an Action while within 5 feet."
