    "rawSource": "#### 4th Level: Secondary Detonation\nWhenever you deal Thunder Damage as a result of a Weapon with the Splash (X) Property, you can cause a Secondary Detonation (no Action required). Choose a point you can see that is within 15 feet of the centre of the original effect, and resolve that Attack or Trap again centred on that location. However, the Damage of this Secondary Detonation is halved, and if a Creature succeeds on the Saving Throw, they take no Damage. These Secondary Detonations cannot generate additional Secondary Detonations.\n:\nYou may use this Feature a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and recover all expended uses upon finishing a Long Rest.\n\n\n\\column"
