    "content": "<h4>10th Level: Bigger Booms</h4>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Bigger really is better, sometimes. You gain the following benefits:</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Enhanced Payload.</strong> When you take the Attack Action, you can double the value of X for any Weapon with the Splash (X) Property wielded by you for that Action.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Sharpened Shrapnel.</strong> Your Martial DC is increased by 2 for the purpose of the Splash (X) Property</p>",
