    "itemType": "feat",
    "level": 10,
    "systemData": {},
    "content": "<h4>10th Level: Siege Bolt</h4>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">A shot to pierce the heavens.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">As an Action, choose a Creature or Object you can see within 100 feet of you; that Creature must make a Dexterity Saving Throw (objects automatically fail) against your Martial DC. On a Successful Save, they suffer 5d8 Piercing Damage immediately, and no further effects. On a failed Save, they take 5d8 Piercing Damage immediately, and at the end of each of their next two turns. They may reattempt the Saving Throw at the beginning of their Turn, ending the effect early on a Success. Damage dealt by this Feature ignores Resistances and Damage Reduction to Piercing Damage.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Once you have used this Feature, you may not do so again until you have finished a Long Rest.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### 10th Level: Siege Bolt\nA shot to pierce the heavens.\n:\nAs an Action, choose a Creature or Object you can see within 100 feet of you; that Creature must make a Dexterity Saving Throw (objects automatically fail) against your Martial DC. On a Successful Save, they suffer 5d8 Piercing Damage immediately, and no further effects. On a failed Save, they take 5d8 Piercing Damage immediately, and at the end of each of their next two turns. They may reattempt the Saving Throw at the beginning of their Turn, ending the effect early on a Success. Damage dealt by this Feature ignores Resistances and Damage Reduction to Piercing Damage.\n:\nOnce you have used this Feature, you may not do so again until you have finished a Long Rest."
