    "itemType": "feat",
    "level": null,
    "systemData": {},
    "content": "<h5>Flinger Arts Casting</h5>\n<div class=\"ak5e-source-table-wrap\"><table class=\"ak5e-source-table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Level</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Maximum Art Level</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Arts Points</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">1st</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">1</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">3</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">2nd</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">1</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">3</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">3rd</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">1</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">3</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">4th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">1</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">4</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">5th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">1</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">4</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">6th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">1</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">4</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">7th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">2</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">6</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">8th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">2</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">6</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">9th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">2</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">6</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">10th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">2</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">7</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">11th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">2</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">7</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">12th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">2</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">7</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">13th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">3</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">10</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">14th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">3</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">10</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">15th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">3</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">10</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">16th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">3</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">11</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">17th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">3</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">11</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">18th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">3</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">11</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">19th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">4</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">12</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">20th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">4</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">12</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
    "rawSource": "##### Flinger Arts Casting\n| Level | Maximum Art Level | Arts Points |\n|:-----:|:-----------------:|:-----------:|\n| 1st   |         1         |      3      |\n| 2nd   |         1         |      3      |\n| 3rd   |         1         |      3      |\n| 4th   |         1         |      4      |\n| 5th   |         1         |      4      |\n| 6th   |         1         |      4      |\n| 7th   |         2         |      6      |\n| 8th   |         2         |      6      |\n| 9th   |         2         |      6      |\n| 10th  |         2         |      7      |\n| 11th  |         2         |      7      |\n| 12th  |         2         |      7      |\n| 13th  |         3         |      10      |\n| 14th  |         3         |      10      |\n| 15th  |         3         |      10     |\n| 16th  |         3         |      11     |\n| 17th  |         3         |      11     |\n| 18th  |         3         |      11     |\n| 19th  |         4         |      12     |\n| 20th  |         4         |      12     |\n\n}}\n\n{{imageMaskEdge1,--offset:-1%,--rotation:80\n<img \n src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/c/c4/Rosmontis.png?1caa69&20230926235418' \n  style='position:absolute;top:180px;right:100px;width:900px' />\n}}\n\n{{imageMaskEdge1,--offset:0%,--rotation:0\n<img \n src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/c/c4/Rosmontis.png?1caa69&20230926235418' \n  style='position:absolute;top:180px;right:100px;width:900px' />\n}}\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\\page\n{{pageNumber,auto}}"
