    "rawSource": "#### 1st Level: Devastator\nYour Attacks strike with such force that they can punch through multiple foes. \n:\nWhen you make a Ranged Attack against a Creature within the Normal Range of that Weapon, that Attack has +1 Critical Range. Additionally, if you reduce that Creature to 0 Hit Points with an Attack using your Custom Job, and there is another Creature that is:\n- Behind the original Creature from your perspective.\n- Within 10 feet of the original Creature.\n- Has an AC equal to or less than the Attack Roll made for that Attack.\n\n{{align-text:left\nThat Creature then takes any excess Damage from the initial Attack. If the Creature reduced to 0 was your Target, then roll an additional die of Damage for that Attack, and add it to the excess Damage taken by the second Creature.\n}}\n\n\n\n{{imageMaskEdge1,--offset:2%,--rotation:90\n<img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/d/d2/OD-Schwarz_Takes_Aim_1.png?7bad37' \n  style='position:absolute;top:250px;right:-200px;width:1500px;;border-radius: 100%;' />\n}}\n\n{{imageMaskEdge1,--offset:22%,--rotation:0\n<img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/d/d2/OD-Schwarz_Takes_Aim_1.png?7bad37' \n  style='position:absolute;top:250px;right:-200px;width:1500px;;border-radius: 100%;' />\n}}\n\n\\page\n{{pageNumber,auto}}\n\n{{wide"
