    "rawSource": "#### 1st Level: Empowered Shots\nHunter Marksmen employ special technology to infuse their weapons with Arts, pushing them beyond what pure mechanics can do alone.\n:\n**Charges.** You have a maximum of 2 Charges, increasing to 4 at Level 7, and 6 at Level 14. \n:\n**Regaining Charges.** You may regain all of your expended Charges as an Action during your Turn, or whenever you finish a Short or Long Rest.\n:\n**Expending Charges.** Whenever you make a Ranged Weapon Attack, 1 Charge is expended to perform an Empowered Shot. At 1st Level, you may only use the following Empowered Shot; you gain additional Options at 4th Level.\n:\n- **Piercing Shot.** If the Attack Hits, it deals 1d8 additional Piercing Damage.\n\n{{align-text:left\nWhen you would perform an Empowered Shot against your Target, you do not expend Charge for the first Empowered Shot option you use. This reduction can only occur once per Attack.\n}}"
