    "rawSource": "#### 4th Level: Enhanced Empowered Shots\nThe ways in which you can infuse your Attacks with your technology becomes more versatile. You gain the following benefits:\n\n**Additional Empowered Shots.** You gain the following Empowered Shot options:\n- **Concussive Shot:** If the Attack Hits, that Creature must succeed on a Strength Saving Throw against your Martial DC or be knocked 10 feet directly away from you.\n- **Dazing Shot:** If the Attack Hits, that Creature must succeed on a Constitution Saving Throw against your Martial DC or be Dazed until the end of their next Turn.\n- **Fragmentation Shot:** Other Creatures behind the target Creature from your perspective and within 10 feet of them take 1d8 Thunder Damage.\n- **Seeking Shot:** Roll 1d6 and add the result to the result of the Attack Roll for that Attack.\n\n{{align-text:left\n**Double Up.** When you perform an Empowered Shot, you may expend a Charge to apply an additional Empowered Shot effect; you may not pick the same option twice for the same Attack.\n}}"
