    "content": "<h4>18th Level: Let the Light In</h4>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">For brief moments, you and your weapon are as one; man and machine working in concord to the same ends. Your flow state guides you and your weapon to a single goal; punching as many holes in your foes as you can.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You may use this Feature as an Action; as part of that Action, you regain all expended Charges. For the next minute, you regain use of your Target Lock Feature at the beginning of each of your Turns, and you may regain all of your expended Charges as a Bonus Action.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Once you have used this Feature, you may not do so again until you have completed a Long Rest.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### 18th Level: Let the Light In\nFor brief moments, you and your weapon are as one; man and machine working in concord to the same ends. Your flow state guides you and your weapon to a single goal; punching as many holes in your foes as you can.\n:\nYou may use this Feature as an Action; as part of that Action, you regain all expended Charges. For the next minute, you regain use of your Target Lock Feature at the beginning of each of your Turns, and you may regain all of your expended Charges as a Bonus Action.\n\n:\nOnce you have used this Feature, you may not do so again until you have completed a Long Rest.\n\n}}\n\n<img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/b/b0/Coldshot.png?8c9e4d&20230927014734' \n  style='position:absolute;top:380px;right:400px;width:330px' />\n  \n<img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/3/34/Ray.png?d0422a&20240109092107' \n  style='position:absolute;top:380px;right:50px;width:330px' />\n\n\\page\n{{pageNumber,auto}}"
