    "content": "<h4>18th Level: Both Barrels</h4>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Give 'em both barrels.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">As an Action while you are wielding a weapon that has a Shell loaded, you can unleash a devastating attack. The form of that assault depends on the Shell loaded, as detailed below:</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">• <strong>Dragon's Breath.</strong> Creatures within a 50 foot Cone originating from you must make a Dexterity Saving Throw against your Martial DC. On a failed Save, they take 8d8 Fire Damage and begin Burning. On a successful Save, they take half as much Damage and suffer no other effects.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">• <strong>Flechette.</strong> Creatures within a 50 foot Cone originating from you must make a Dexterity Saving Throw against your Martial DC. On a failed Save, they take 8d8 Piercing Damage, and their Movement Speed is halved. They may reattempt this Saving Throw at the end of each of their Turns, ending this effect on a success. On a successful Save, they take half as much Damage, and suffer no other effects.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">• <strong>Slug.</strong> A Creature of your Choice that you can see within 60 feet must make a Constitution Saving Throw against your Martial DC. On a failed Save, they take Piercing Damage equal to five times the Damage an Attack using that weapon would have dealt to them. On a successful Save, they take half as much Damage. Damage dealt by this Feature ignores Damage Reduction.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">• <strong>Beanbag.</strong> Creatures within a 50 foot Cone originating from you must make a Dexterity Saving Throw against your Martial DC. On a failed Save, they take 8d8 Bludgeoning Damage, and are Dazed. They may reattempt this Saving Throw at the end of each of their Turns, ending this effect on a success. On a successful Save, they take half as much Damage, and suffer no other effects. If a Creature is reduced to 0 Hit Points by this Damage, they are knocked Unconscious instead of Dying.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Once you have used this Feature, you cannot do so again until you complete a Long Rest.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### 18th Level: Both Barrels\nGive 'em both barrels. \n:\nAs an Action while you are wielding a weapon that has a Shell loaded, you can unleash a devastating attack. The form of that assault depends on the Shell loaded, as detailed below:\n- **Dragon's Breath.** Creatures within a 50 foot Cone originating from you must make a Dexterity Saving Throw against your Martial DC. On a failed Save, they take 8d8 Fire Damage and begin Burning. On a successful Save, they take half as much Damage and suffer no other effects.\n- **Flechette.** Creatures within a 50 foot Cone originating from you must make a Dexterity Saving Throw against your Martial DC. On a failed Save, they take 8d8 Piercing Damage, and their Movement Speed is halved. They may reattempt this Saving Throw at the end of each of their Turns, ending this effect on a success. On a successful Save, they take half as much Damage, and suffer no other effects. \n- **Slug.** A Creature of your Choice that you can see within 60 feet must make a Constitution Saving Throw against your Martial DC. On a failed Save, they take Piercing Damage equal to five times the Damage an Attack using that weapon would have dealt to them. On a successful Save, they take half as much Damage. Damage dealt by this Feature ignores Damage Reduction.\n- **Beanbag.** Creatures within a 50 foot Cone originating from you must make a Dexterity Saving Throw against your Martial DC. On a failed Save, they take 8d8 Bludgeoning Damage, and are Dazed. They may reattempt this Saving Throw at the end of each of their Turns, ending this effect on a success. On a successful Save, they take half as much Damage, and suffer no other effects. If a Creature is reduced to 0 Hit Points by this Damage, they are knocked Unconscious instead of Dying.\n\n{{align-text:left\nOnce you have used this Feature, you cannot do so again until you complete a Long Rest.\n}}\n\n}}\n\n\n\n\n\n{{imageMaskEdge1,--offset:-5%,--rotation:-9\n<img src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/thumb/8/86/Executor_Skin_1.png/1024px-Executor_Skin_1.png?c3c651' \n  style='position:absolute;top:250px;right:-150px;width:1300px;clip-path:rect(auto auto auto auto);' />\n}}\n\n\n\n\\page\n{{pageNumber,auto}}\n\n\n\n{{wide"
