    "rawSource": "#### Hit Points\n**Hit Dice:** 1d6 per Medic Level<br>\n**Hit Points at 1st Level:** 6 + your Constitution Modifier<br>\n**Hit Points at Higher Levels:** 1d6 (or 4) + your Constitution Modifier per Medic Level after 1st"
