    "rawSource": "#### Proficiencies\n**Armor:** Light Shields<br>\n**Weapons:** Light Melee<br>\n**Tools:** A Tool Kit/Vehicle Proficiency of your Choice<br>\n**Saving Throws:** Choose Two from the following: Constitution, Intelligence, Wisdom  <br>\n**Skills:** Medicine + Two from: Lore, Arts, Tech, Insight, Perception, Persuasion"
