    "content": "<h5>Artseeker</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 10<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 10<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Offensive<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 1 Round</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Ranged Spell Attack Rolls you make this Turn are made with Advantage, and ignore the benefits of Half and Three-Quarters Cover.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Medic / Basic Medic Skills</p>",
    "rawSource": "| Artseeker\t| 10\t| 10\t| Offensive\t| Bonus Action\t| Ranged Spell Attack Rolls you make this Turn are made with Advantage, and ignore the benefits of Half and Three-Quarters Cover. |\t 1 Round"
