    "content": "<h5>Anaesthesia</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 30<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 10<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Offensive<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You release a 15-foot-radius sphere of debillitating gas centered on a grounded point you can see within 20 feet of you. When a Creature enters the gas or starts its Turn there, they must succeed on a Constitution Saving Throw or suffer Nervous Impairment until the beginning of their next Turn. The cloud moves 10 feet along the ground at the beginning of each of your Turns, as if it were moving away from the location you used this Skill at.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Medic / Advanced Medic Skills</p>",
    "rawSource": "| Anaesthesia | 30 | 10 | Offensive | Action | You release a 15-foot-radius sphere of debillitating gas centered on a grounded point you can see within 20 feet of you. When a Creature enters the gas or starts its Turn there, they must succeed on a Constitution Saving Throw or suffer Nervous Impairment until the beginning of their next Turn. The cloud moves 10 feet along the ground at the beginning of each of your Turns, as if it were moving away from the location you used this Skill at.| 3 Rounds |"
