    "content": "<h5>Auto-Protect</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 20<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 10<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> Instant</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">When you restore Hit Points to a Creature, you can activate this Skill to grant one of those Creatures Resistance to all Damage. That Creature loses that Resistance after they have taken any Damage, or after 1 minute has passed.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Medic / Advanced Medic Skills</p>",
