    "content": "<h5>Laser Focus</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 20<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 20<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> Instant</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">As part of using this Skill, you may cast an Art with a Casting Time of Action, and that covers an Area of Effect (such as a Cone, Sphere, or Cube). The range and affected area of that Art is replaced with a Line originating from you, 120 feet in length and 5 foot in width, for that casting only. Creatures that have to make a Saving Throw against that Art this Turn have Disadvantage on that Saving Throw.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Medic / Advanced Medic Skills</p>",
