    "content": "<h5>In Tune</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 50<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 30<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 5 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Originium Arts permeate your very form, temporarily ascending you to a higher state. For the duration, Attacks made against you are made at Disadvantage, and you have Advantage on all Saving Throws. Furthermore, whenever you roll a d20, if the natural result of the dice is 9 or less, treat it as if you had rolled a 10.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Medic / Elite Medic Skills</p>",
