    "content": "<h5>Leyline</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 65<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 30<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 5 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">For the duration, your Movement Speed is reduced to 0 and cannot be increased. However, you gain a +3 Bonus to your Spell Attack Rolls, your Spell Save DC is increased by 3, and when you roll to determine the Damage or Hit Points restored of an Art, if the result is less than half of the maximum, it becomes equal to half of the maximum. You may end this Skill early as an Action during your Turn.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Medic / Elite Medic Skills</p>",
