    "content": "<h5>Supreme Care</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 100<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 30<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> Until Long Rest</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">For the duration, whenever you roll to determine the amount of Hit Points you restore to a Creature, you may roll one additional die and add it to the total. Additionally, once per Turn when you roll to determine the amount of Hit Points restored, you may roll those dice a second time and use either total.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Medic / Elite Medic Skills</p>",
