    "content": "<h5>The Past, Unwritten</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 80<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 40<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> Instant</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Choose two willing Creatures you can see within 100 feet; add up their total Hit Points, and divide the result by two, rounding up. If the current Hit Points of either Creature are less than this value, they gain Hit Points until it is equal to that value; this is considered to be you restoring Hit Points to that Creature.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Medic / Elite Medic Skills</p>",
