    "rawSource": "#### 7th Level: Hypocritic Oath\nAll medicine has at least two outcomes, depending on the dose.\n:\nWhen you roll to determine the Hit Points restored to a Creature, you may instead choose to harm them. That Creature must make a Constitution Saving Throw against your Spell Save DC; on a failed Save, they instead take Necrotic Damage equal to the amount of Hit Points they would have recovered. On a successful Save, they take half as much Necrotic Damage.\n:\nThis Damage is still considered to be restoring Hit Points for the purpose of any Features that require it."
