    "level": 15,
    "systemData": {},
    "content": "<h4>15th Level: Surgeon-General</h4>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">When you restore Hit Points to a single Creature using your Life Support Feature, an Art, or an Operator Skill, the amount of Hit Points you restore is doubled.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### 15th Level: Surgeon-General\nWhen you restore Hit Points to a single Creature using your Life Support Feature, an Art, or an Operator Skill, the amount of Hit Points you restore is doubled.\n\n{{imageMaskEdge1,--offset:1.5%,--rotation:265\n<img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/e/e5/Sussurro_Elite_2.png?19ff54&20230926223902' \n  style='position:absolute;top:200px;right:-300px;width:800px' />\n}}\n\n\n\n\n\\page\n{{pageNumber,auto}}\n\n{{imageMaskEdge1,--offset:1%,--rotation:90\n<img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/0/0e/Whisperain.png?15921e&20230927011826' \n  style='position:absolute;top:50px;right:100px;width:1000px' />\n}}\n\n\n\n\\column"
