    "content": "<h4>1st Level: Prevention, not Cure</h4>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Your unique twist on medical Arts is designed to keep people from reaching harm, rather than putting them back together. You gain the following benefits:</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Ward.</strong> Whenever you would roll to Restore Hit Points to a Creature, you can instead grant that same amount of Temporary Hit Points. These Temporary Hit Points are known as your Ward, and interact with your other Features.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Additional Temporary Hit Points.</strong> Whenever you grant Temporary Hit Points as a result of an Action or Bonus Action, roll 1d8 and add the result to the amount of Temporary Hit Points granted. Additionally, if those Temporary Hit Points were granted as a result of an Art, increased the amount granted by the number of Arts Points spent on that Art.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### 1st Level: Prevention, not Cure\nYour unique twist on medical Arts is designed to keep people from reaching harm, rather than putting them back together. You gain the following benefits:\n\n**Ward.** Whenever you would roll to Restore Hit Points to a Creature, you can instead grant that same amount of Temporary Hit Points. These Temporary Hit Points are known as your Ward, and interact with your other Features.\n\n**Additional Temporary Hit Points.** Whenever you grant Temporary Hit Points as a result of an Action or Bonus Action, roll 1d8 and add the result to the amount of Temporary Hit Points granted. Additionally, if those Temporary Hit Points were granted as a result of an Art, increased the amount granted by the number of Arts Points spent on that Art."
