    "parentBranch": "Witchcraft",
    "sourceHeading": "15th Level: Life through Death",
    "itemType": "feat",
    "level": 15,
    "systemData": {},
    "content": "<h4>15th Level: Life through Death</h4>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">When you roll to determine the Damage of an Art or Operator Skill, you can choose not to roll, and instead deal the maximum amount possible. If you do, you can then restore a number of Hit Points equal to the amount rolled. Choose a number of Creatures you can see within 60 feet of you, and divide those Hit Points between them.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Once you have used this Feature, you may not do so again until you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### 15th Level: Life through Death\nWhen you roll to determine the Damage of an Art or Operator Skill, you can choose not to roll, and instead deal the maximum amount possible. If you do, you can then restore a number of Hit Points equal to the amount rolled. Choose a number of Creatures you can see within 60 feet of you, and divide those Hit Points between them.\n:\nOnce you have used this Feature, you may not do so again until you finish a Long Rest.\n\n}}\n\n{{imageMaskEdge5,--offset:-7%,--rotation:0\n<img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/5/5b/Hibiscus_the_Purifier_Elite_2.png?ba650b&20230927001357' \n  style='position:absolute;top:300px;right:-100px;width:1000px;clip-path:rect(11.5% auto auto auto);' />\n}}\n\n\n\n\\page\n{{pageNumber,auto}}"
