    "content": "<h2>Doll</h2>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><em>Construct the same size as you, Neutral</em><br>___<br><strong>Armor Class</strong> :: 10 + Dexterity<br><strong>Hit Points</strong>  :: Same as your Maximum Hit Points<br><strong>Speed</strong>       :: Same as your Walking Speed.<br>___</p>\n<div class=\"ak5e-source-table-wrap\"><table class=\"ak5e-source-table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">STR</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">DEX</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">CON</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">INT</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">WIS</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">CHA</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">16 (+3)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">16 (+3)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">14 (+2)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">1 (-5)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">10 (+0)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">4  (-3)</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">___<br><strong>Damage Immunities</strong>    :: Poison, Necrotic<br><strong>Condition Immunities</strong> :: Charmed, Frightened, Poisoned, Necrotised, Nervous Impairment<br><strong>Senses</strong>               :: Darkvision 60 ft., passive Perception 8 + your PB<br><strong>Languages</strong>            :: Understands languages you speak but cannot speak.<br><strong>Challenge</strong>            :: - (0 XP) <strong>Proficiency Bonus</strong> Your PB<br>___<br><strong><em>Artificial.</em></strong> This Creature does not need to breathe, nor requires food or drink.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Self-Rejuvenation.</em></strong> If this Creature has more than one Hit Point when it completes a Long Rest, it regains all missing Hit Points.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Murderous Marionette.</em></strong> This Creature has Advantage on Melee Attacks against Creatures that are within your Reach.</p>\n<h3>Actions</h3>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Strike.</em></strong> The Doll makes an Attack using a weapon it is wielding, or an Unarmed Strike if it has no weapons.</p>",
    "rawSource": "## Doll\n*Construct the same size as you, Neutral*\n___\n**Armor Class** :: 10 + Dexterity\n**Hit Points**  :: Same as your Maximum Hit Points\n**Speed**       :: Same as your Walking Speed.\n___\n|  STR  |  DEX  |  CON  |  INT  |  WIS  |  CHA  |\n|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|\n|16 (+3)|16 (+3)|14 (+2)|1 (-5) |10 (+0)|4  (-3)|\n___\n**Damage Immunities**    :: Poison, Necrotic\n**Condition Immunities** :: Charmed, Frightened, Poisoned, Necrotised, Nervous Impairment\n**Senses**               :: Darkvision 60 ft., passive Perception 8 + your PB\n**Languages**            :: Understands languages you speak but cannot speak.\n**Challenge**            :: - (0 XP) {{bonus **Proficiency Bonus** Your PB}}\n___\n***Artificial.*** This Creature does not need to breathe, nor requires food or drink.\n:\n***Self-Rejuvenation.*** If this Creature has more than one Hit Point when it completes a Long Rest, it regains all missing Hit Points.\n:\n***Murderous Marionette.*** This Creature has Advantage on Melee Attacks against Creatures that are within your Reach.\n\n### Actions\n***Strike.*** The Doll makes an Attack using a weapon it is wielding, or an Unarmed Strike if it has no weapons."
