    "systemData": {},
    "content": "<h5>Deadly Fighter</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">The first time each Turn you make an Attack Roll using a Weapon with the Deadly Property, the Critical Range of that Attack is increased by 1.</p>",
