    "content": "<h5>Death Detonation</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 10<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 10<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> Instant</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You can also use this Operator Skill as a Reaction when a Construct created by you would be reduced to 0 Hit Points; Choose a Construct that was created by you. All Creatures within 10 feet of that Construct must make a Dexterity Saving Throw against either your Martial DC or Spell Save DC. On a failed Save, they take 5d6 Thunder Damage. On a successful Save, they take half as much Damage.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Specialist / Basic Specialist Skills</p>",
    "rawSource": "| Death Detonation\t| 10\t| 10\t| Automatic\t| Action\t| You can also use this Operator Skill as a Reaction when a Construct created by you would be reduced to 0 Hit Points; Choose a Construct that was created by you. All Creatures within 10 feet of that Construct must make a Dexterity Saving Throw against either your Martial DC or Spell Save DC. On a failed Save, they take 5d6 Thunder Damage. On a successful Save, they take half as much Damage. | Instant"
