    "content": "<h5>Exorcise Evil</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 15<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 5<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You may use this Operator Skill when you hit a Creature with a Melee Attack; you apply an Exorcism Mark to that Creature. At the end of the duration, the Mark detonates, and that Creature takes 1d4 Force Damage for each time it was hit by an Attack while it had that Exorcism Mark. You may cause the Mark to detonate as a Reaction, ending the Skill early. If the Damage from the Mark reduces a Creature to 0 Hit Points, you immediately gain 10 Skill Points.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Specialist / Basic Specialist Skills</p>",
