    "content": "<h5>Sap</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 10<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 5<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 1 Attack</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Creatures hit by your next Melee Attack must succeed on a Constitution Saving Throw against your Martial DC or become Dazed until the end of their next Turn.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Specialist / Basic Specialist Skills</p>",
    "rawSource": "| Sap\t| 10\t| 5\t| Automatic\t| Bonus Action\t| Creatures hit by your next Melee Attack must succeed on a Constitution Saving Throw against your Martial DC or become Dazed until the end of their next Turn.\t| 1 Attack"
