    "content": "<h5>Area Overwatch</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 30<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 15<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 4 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">When a Creature you can see within 100ft of you moves 5 or more feet during their Turn, you can make a Ranged Weapon Attack against them as a Reaction. If this Attack hits, you regain use of your Reaction. However, you can only Attack each Creature once per Turn. This Skill ends early if you move more than 5 feet during a Turn.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Specialist / Advanced Specialist Skills</p>",
    "rawSource": "| Area Overwatch\t| 30\t | 15\t| Automatic\t| Action\t| When a Creature you can see within 100ft of you moves 5 or more feet during their Turn, you can make a Ranged Weapon Attack against them as a Reaction. If this Attack hits, you regain use of your Reaction. However, you can only Attack each Creature once per Turn. This Skill ends early if you move more than 5 feet during a Turn.\t| 4 Rounds"
