    "content": "<h5>Pursuit</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 20<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 10<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Offensive<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Reaction<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 1 Round</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You can use this Operator Skill when a Creature within your Reach takes the Disengage Action. Once during this Turn, after they move, you may move up to your Speed towards them ; if they are within your Reach when you finish this Movement, you may make a Melee Attack against them (no Action required).</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Specialist / Advanced Specialist Skills</p>",
