      "cost": 30,
      "start": 20,
      "methods": [
        "offensive"
      ],
      "activation": "Reaction",
      "duration": "Instant",
      "effect": "You can use this Operator Skill at any point when you are not in contact with the ground, you immediately fall directly downwards until you hit the ground; you do not take Damage from this fall. Instead, all other Creatures within 15 feet of where you landed must make a Dexterity Saving Throw against your Martial DC; on a failed Save, they take 1d10 Thunder Damage for every 10 feet you fell. On a successful Save, they take half as much Damage.",
