    "content": "<h5>To Part The Seas</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 40<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 15<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> Instant</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You can only use this Operator Skill while you are wielding a weapon with the Thrown Property. You launch the weapon in a water-parting line, up to 100 feet long and 5 foot wide; all Creatures within the area must make a Dexterity Saving Throw against your Martial DC. On a failed Save, they take 8d6 Piercing Damage. On a successful Save, they take half as much Damage.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Specialist / Advanced Specialist Skills Continued</p>",
