    "content": "<h5>Umbral Ambush</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 40<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 10<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Offensive<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 2 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You gain the Invisible Condition; this Condition is not removed when you make an Attack. If you reduce a Creature to 0 Hit Points while Invisible, the duration of this Skill is extended by 1 Round, up to a maximum of 5 Rounds.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Specialist / Advanced Specialist Skills Continued</p>",
