    "content": "<h5>Afterimage</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 80<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 40<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">After you make an Attack, you may repeat that Attack (no Action required); you must target the same Creature, and if it hits, that Attack deals half Damage. These additional Attacks cannot generate further Attacks. Additionally, if you have made an Attack during your Turn while this Skill is Active, your AC is increased by a value equal to your Proficiency Bonus until the beginning of your next Turn.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Specialist / Elite Specialist Skills</p>",
