    "content": "<h5>Continental Style</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 40<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 30<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 5 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">For the duration, you do not have Disadvantage on Ranged Attack Rolls when there is a hostile Creature within 5 feet of you. Additionally, for each Ranged Attack you make during a Turn, you may make a single Melee Attack during that Turn (no Action required). A Creature that you have made a Melee Attack against cannot make Opportunity Attacks against you for the remainder of the Turn.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Specialist / Elite Specialist Skills</p>",
