    "content": "<h5>Finality</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 40<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 20<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> Instant</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You can use this Operator Skill when you hit a Creature that has a detrimental Status Condition with an Attack; all Status Conditions are removed from that Creature, and that Attack deals 3d10 additional Force Damage for each Condition removed.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Specialist / Elite Specialist Skills</p>",
