    "content": "<h5>Harpoon Shot</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 65<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 30<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> Instant</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Choose a Creature you can see within 100 feet. That Creature must make a Dexterity Saving Throw against your Martial DC; on a failed Save, they take 5d8 Piercing Damage and are tethered. On a successful Save, they take half as much Damage,  but are not tethered. A tethered Creature has its Speed halved, and takes 5d8 Piercing Damage at the beginning of each of its Turns. As an Action during its Turn, a tethered Creature may reattempt the Saving Throw, ending the tether on a success.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Specialist / Elite Specialist Skills</p>",
