    "content": "<h5>Silencer</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 65<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 35<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Offensive<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">When you make an Attack Roll, you may roll that dice two additional times, keeping the highest result and discarding the others. In addition, your Critical Range is improved by 1.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Specialist / Elite Specialist Skills</p>",
