    "content": "<h5>Torrential Downpour</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 65<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 30<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">When you activate this Operator Skill, and at the beginning of each of your Turns for the duration, up to 5 different Creatures of your choice within 30 feet of you must make a Dexterity Saving Throw against your Martial DC as your Arts hammer upon them like rain. On a failed Save, they take 3d6 Force Damage; on a successful Save, they take half as much Damage.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Specialist / Elite Specialist Skills</p>",
