      "tier": "Elite",
      "cost": 65,
      "start": 30,
      "methods": [
        "automatic"
      ],
      "activation": "Action",
      "duration": "Instant",
      "effect": "You create a vacuum effect by slashing the very air with your Arts; Creatures of your choice within 30 feet of you must make a Strength Saving Throw against your Martial DC. On a failed Save, they take 10d6 Slashing Damage and are pulled up to 20 feet directly towards you. On a successful Save, they take half as much Damage, and are only pulled 10 feet towards you. After this Damage is dealt, you may immediately expend your Bonus Action to teleport to a location you can see within 60 feet.",
