    "content": "<h4>1st Level: Equipment Modification</h4>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You can modify non-magical weapons and armour with special Modifications.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Inventions.</strong> You have a number of Inventions equal to twice your Proficiency Bonus that you expend to modify equipment. Each Modification you apply consumes 1 Invention; this Invention is refunded when that Modification is removed.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Modifying Equipment.</strong> Over the course of 10 minutes, you can modify or remove Modifications from a non-magical Weapon or piece of Armour that you can work on for the duration. If you do so, you may apply any number of valid Modifications, listed below, to that equipment. A piece of equipment cannot have duplicate Modifications. If you cannot maintain a modification for whatever reason, such as the equipment being lost or stolen, the Modification is automatically removed after a week.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Activating Modifications.</strong> Each Modification describes the Action cost to active that Modification.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Instability.</strong> Any piece of equipment with Modifications on it has an Instability Value; this begins at 3, and increases by 1 for each Modification after the first placed on it. When a Creature activates a Modification, they roll a number of d6's equal to that equipment's Instability; if any of those dice show the same result as another die, that equipment suffers a breakdown; the wielder or wearer loses 1d8 Hit Points, plus an additional 1d8 for every Instability above 3 that equipment has. This loss of Hit Points cannot reduce you below 1 Hit Point.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### 1st Level: Equipment Modification\nYou can modify non-magical weapons and armour with special Modifications. \n\n**Inventions.** You have a number of Inventions equal to twice your Proficiency Bonus that you expend to modify equipment. Each Modification you apply consumes 1 Invention; this Invention is refunded when that Modification is removed.\n\n**Modifying Equipment.** Over the course of 10 minutes, you can modify or remove Modifications from a non-magical Weapon or piece of Armour that you can work on for the duration. If you do so, you may apply any number of valid Modifications, listed below, to that equipment. A piece of equipment cannot have duplicate Modifications. If you cannot maintain a modification for whatever reason, such as the equipment being lost or stolen, the Modification is automatically removed after a week.\n\n**Activating Modifications.** Each Modification describes the Action cost to active that Modification. \n\n**Instability.** Any piece of equipment with Modifications on it has an Instability Value; this begins at 3, and increases by 1 for each Modification after the first placed on it. When a Creature activates a Modification, they roll a number of d6's equal to that equipment's Instability; if any of those dice show the same result as another die, that equipment suffers a breakdown; the wielder or wearer loses 1d8 Hit Points, plus an additional 1d8 for every Instability above 3 that equipment has. This loss of Hit Points cannot reduce you below 1 Hit Point.\n \n\n}}\n\n{{imageMaskEdge1,--offset:-4%,--rotation:0\n<img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/4/42/Exusiai_the_New_Covenant_Elite_2.png?c8c1b2&20250502140259' \n  style='position:absolute;top:280px;right:-50px;width:900px;clip-path:rect(20% auto auto auto);' />\n}}\n\n\n\n\n\\page\n{{pageNumber,auto}}"
