    "content": "<h5>Stranger Contraptions</h5>\n<div class=\"ak5e-source-table-wrap\"><table class=\"ak5e-source-table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__left\">Stranger Contraption</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__left\">12 Million Lumen Flashlight</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Creatures that succeed on the Saving Throw are Dazed until the end of their next Turn.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__left\">Fun Toy</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">The Mobile Camera has the Invisible Condition.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__left\">Musbeast Remover</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Creatures that fail the Saving Throw suffer the Bleeding Condition.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__left\">Needlefly Fumigator</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">When you use this Strange Contraption, you may choose any number of Creatures to be immune to its effects until the end of their next Turn.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__left\">Over-tuned Speaker</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">You can now control the volume of the sound produced, and may also pick a particular direction to direct the sound.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__left\">Portable Firestarter</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">When a Creature or Object takes Damage from the Burning Condition that was gained through this Strange Contraption, the Fire Damage taken is increased by your Intelligence Bonus.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__left\">Universal Keycard</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">No longer leaves a trace.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__left\">Unstable Contraption</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Damage increased to 8d8.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
    "rawSource": "##### Stranger Contraptions\n| Stranger Contraption | Effect                              |\n|:------------------- |:-----------------------------------:|\n| 12 Million Lumen Flashlight | Creatures that succeed on the Saving Throw are Dazed until the end of their next Turn. |\n| Fun Toy             | The Mobile Camera has the Invisible Condition. |\n| Musbeast Remover    | Creatures that fail the Saving Throw suffer the Bleeding Condition.\n| Needlefly Fumigator | When you use this Strange Contraption, you may choose any number of Creatures to be immune to its effects until the end of their next Turn.\n| Over-tuned Speaker   | You can now control the volume of the sound produced, and may also pick a particular direction to direct the sound.\n| Portable Firestarter | When a Creature or Object takes Damage from the Burning Condition that was gained through this Strange Contraption, the Fire Damage taken is increased by your Intelligence Bonus.\n| Universal Keycard   | No longer leaves a trace.\n| Unstable Contraption | Damage increased to 8d8.\n\n\\column"
