    "content": "<h4>1st Level: Take Flight</h4>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">The field of avionics in Terra is stumbling and childish; like Icarus, you have burst beyond the bounds of safety. Only time will tell if you follow his example.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Flight Suit.</strong> When you choose this Branch, a Flight Suit is added to your starting equipment; replacing a Flight Suit costs 650 LMD and 24 hours of crafting time.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">A Flight Suit is Light Armour with an AC of 12 + your Dexterity Modifier, 0 DR, and a weight of 25lb.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">While any Creature with Light Armour Proficiency can wear a Flight Suit, only Creatures with the Take Flight Feature can use it to fly.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Fuel.</strong> You have a special resource called Fuel that you use to power your flight and some of your other Features; the maximum amount of Fuel you have increases with your Specialist Level, as shown in the Skyranger Features Table. You regain all expended Fuel when you finish a Long Rest.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Take Off.</strong> As a Bonus Action while you are wearing your Flight Suit, you can expend 1 Fuel to grant yourself a Flying Speed equal to your Walking Speed for 1 minute.</p>\n<h5>Skyranger Features</h5>\n<div class=\"ak5e-source-table-wrap\"><table class=\"ak5e-source-table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Level</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Maximum Fuel</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Strafe Damage</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">1</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">2</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">-</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">2</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">2</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">-</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">3</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">3</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">-</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">4</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">3</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">-</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">5</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">3</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">5d8</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">6</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">4</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">5d8</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">7</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">4</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">5d8</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">8</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">4</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">6d8</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">9</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">5</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">6d8</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">10</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">5</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">6d8</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">11</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">5</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">7d8</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">12</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">6</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">7d8</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">13</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">6</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">7d8</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">14</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">6</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">8d8</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">15</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">7</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">8d8</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">16</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">7</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">8d8</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">17</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">7</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">9d8</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">18</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">8</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">9d8</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">19</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">8</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">9d8</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">20</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">8</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">10d8</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
    "rawSource": "#### 1st Level: Take Flight\nThe field of avionics in Terra is stumbling and childish; like Icarus, you have burst beyond the bounds of safety. Only time will tell if you follow his example.\n\n**Flight Suit.** When you choose this Branch, a Flight Suit is added to your starting equipment; replacing a Flight Suit costs 650 LMD and 24 hours of crafting time. \n:\nA Flight Suit is Light Armour with an AC of 12 + your Dexterity Modifier, 0 DR, and a weight of 25lb.\n:\nWhile any Creature with Light Armour Proficiency can wear a Flight Suit, only Creatures with the Take Flight Feature can use it to fly.\n\n**Fuel.** You have a special resource called Fuel that you use to power your flight and some of your other Features; the maximum amount of Fuel you have increases with your Specialist Level, as shown in the Skyranger Features Table. You regain all expended Fuel when you finish a Long Rest.\n\n**Take Off.** As a Bonus Action while you are wearing your Flight Suit, you can expend 1 Fuel to grant yourself a Flying Speed equal to your Walking Speed for 1 minute. \n\n##### Skyranger Features\n| Level | Maximum Fuel | Strafe Damage |\n|:-----:|:------------:|:-------------:|\n| 1     | 2            | -\n| 2     | 2            | -\n| 3     | 3            | -\n| 4     | 3            | -\n| 5     | 3            | 5d8\n| 6     | 4            | 5d8\n| 7     | 4            | 5d8\n| 8     | 4            | 6d8\n| 9     | 5            | 6d8\n| 10    | 5            | 6d8\n| 11    | 5            | 7d8\n| 12    | 6            | 7d8\n| 13    | 6            | 7d8\n| 14    | 6            | 8d8\n| 15    | 7            | 8d8\n| 16    | 7            | 8d8\n| 17    | 7            | 9d8\n| 18    | 8            | 9d8\n| 19    | 8            | 9d8\n| 20    | 8            | 10d8\n\n\n\\column"
