    "content": "<h4>11th Level: Masquerade</h4>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Your Dolls are more advanced; uncannily so. You gain the following benefits:</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Doll Multiattack.</strong> When your Doll takes the Strike Action, it can make one additional Attack as part of it.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Mistaken Identity</strong>. When a Creature would make an Attack against you or your Doll, and the other Creature is within range of that Attack, you can force that Creature to make a DC18 Perception Check. If they fail the Check, you may choose whether that Attack targets you or your Doll. If they succeed on the Check, they become immune to this Feature for 1 hour.<br>You can use this Feature a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and regain all expended uses whenever you finish a Short or Long Rest.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Talking Heads.</strong> Your Doll can now speak using your voice. It will only say what it is ordered to say; if it is within 100 feet of you, you can communicate telepathically what you wish for it to say.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### 11th Level: Masquerade\nYour Dolls are more advanced; uncannily so. You gain the following benefits:\n\n**Doll Multiattack.** When your Doll takes the Strike Action, it can make one additional Attack as part of it. \n\n**Mistaken Identity**. When a Creature would make an Attack against you or your Doll, and the other Creature is within range of that Attack, you can force that Creature to make a DC18 Perception Check. If they fail the Check, you may choose whether that Attack targets you or your Doll. If they succeed on the Check, they become immune to this Feature for 1 hour. \nYou can use this Feature a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and regain all expended uses whenever you finish a Short or Long Rest.\n\n**Talking Heads.** Your Doll can now speak using your voice. It will only say what it is ordered to say; if it is within 100 feet of you, you can communicate telepathically what you wish for it to say."
