    "name": "Dollkeeper: 20th Level: Artistry is Violence",
    "parentClass": "Specialist",
    "parentBranch": "Dollkeeper",
    "sourceHeading": "20th Level: Artistry is Violence",
    "itemType": "feat",
    "level": 20,
    "systemData": {},
    "content": "<h4>20th Level: Artistry is Violence</h4>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Your control over your Doll is legendary. You gain the following benefits:</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Doll Multiattack.</strong> When your Doll takes the Strike Action, it can now make two additional Attacks as part of that Action.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Doll Raid.</strong> When you take the Attack Action, you can also cause your Doll to take the Strike Action (no Action required). Once you have used this Feature, you may not do so again until you have completed a Long Rest.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### 20th Level: Artistry is Violence\nYour control over your Doll is legendary. You gain the following benefits:\n\n**Doll Multiattack.** When your Doll takes the Strike Action, it can now make two additional Attacks as part of that Action.\n\n**Doll Raid.** When you take the Attack Action, you can also cause your Doll to take the Strike Action (no Action required). Once you have used this Feature, you may not do so again until you have completed a Long Rest.\n\n{{imageMaskCorner27,--offsetX:45%,--offsetY:-50%,--rotation:0\n<img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/3/30/Specter_the_Unchained_Skin_1.png?7f9c31&20230927021845' \n  style='position:absolute;top:0px;right:-450px;width:1300px' />\n}}\n\n{{imageMaskCorner27,--offsetX:45%,--offsetY:-23%,--rotation:0\n<img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/3/30/Specter_the_Unchained_Skin_1.png?7f9c31&20230927021845' \n  style='position:absolute;top:0px;right:-450px;width:1300px' />\n}}\n\n\\page\n{{pageNumber,auto}}"
