    "content": "<h2>Protector Creation</h2>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><em>Large Construct, Neutral</em><br>___<br><strong>Armor Class</strong> :: 10<br><strong>Hit Points</strong>  :: 10 + 3 times your Supporter Level<br><strong>Speed</strong>       :: 20 ft.<br>___</p>\n<div class=\"ak5e-source-table-wrap\"><table class=\"ak5e-source-table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">STR</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">DEX</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">CON</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">INT</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">WIS</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">CHA</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">16 (+3)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">8 (-1)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">16 (+3)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">4 (-4)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">10 (+0)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">6  (-2)</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">___<br><strong>Skills</strong>               :: Athletics<br><strong>Damage Immunities</strong>    :: Poison, Necrotic<br><strong>Condition Immunities</strong> :: Charmed, Frightened, Poisoned, Necrotised, Nervous Impairment<br><strong>Senses</strong>               :: Darkvision 60 ft., passive Perception 8 + your PB<br><strong>Languages</strong>            :: Understands the languages you know<br><strong>Challenge</strong>            :: - (0 XP) <strong>Proficiency Bonus</strong> Your PB<br>___<br><strong><em>Arcane Durability.</em></strong> This Creatures has DR against all Damage equal to its Proficiency Bonus.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Artificial Nature.</em></strong> This Creature cannot regain Hit Points except through its Summoner's Symbiosis Feature or its own Features.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Bastion.</em></strong> This Creatures provides Half Cover for allied Creatures within 5 feet of it.</p>\n<h3>Actions</h3>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Slam.</em></strong> <em>Melee Weapon Attack:</em> + Strength Modifier & Proficiency Bonus to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. <em>Hit:</em> 8 (1d8 + 3) Bludgeoning Damage</p>\n<h3>Reactions</h3>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Intervene.</em></strong> When a Creature within this Creature's Reach would make an Attack against a different Creature, this Creature may immediately make a Slam Attack against them. If it hits, that Creature's Attacks are made at Disadvantage until the end of the Turn.</p>",
