    "content": "<h5>Revealing Mist</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 15<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 5<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 5 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You create a 20 foot radius Sphere of silvery mist centred on a location you can see within 100 feet. This mist spreads around corners. When a hostile Creature that has the Invisible Condition or is hiding enters the area, they are revealed, losing the Invisible Condition. Allied Creatures within the area are considered to be in Half Cover.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Supporter / Basic Supporter Skills</p>",
