      "activation": "Action",
      "duration": "4 Rounds",
      "effect": "Choose a point you can see within 30 feet; all Creatures within 10 feet of that point must make a Dexterity Saving Throw against your Martial DC or Spell Save DC (your choice). On a failed Save, they take 4d6 Lightning Damage and are Restrained. On a successful Save, a Creature takes half as much Damage and is not Restrained. As an Action, A Creature Restrained in this way may make an Athletics or Acrobatics Check (Escape DC = DC of the initial Saving Throw), ending the condition on a success. A Creature Restrained in this way takes 2d6 Lightning Damage at the end of their Turn.\tWhen this Skill ends, all Creatures Restrained by it are no longer Restrained.",
