    "content": "<h5>Electrowebbing</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 40<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 20<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 4 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Choose a point you can see within 30 feet; all Creatures within 10 feet of that point must make a Dexterity Saving Throw against your Martial DC or Spell Save DC (your choice). On a failed Save, they take 4d6 Lightning Damage and are Restrained. On a successful Save, a Creature takes half as much Damage and is not Restrained. As an Action, A Creature Restrained in this way may make an Athletics or Acrobatics Check (Escape DC = DC of the initial Saving Throw), ending the condition on a success. A Creature Restrained in this way takes 2d6 Lightning Damage at the end of their Turn.\tWhen this Skill ends, all Creatures Restrained by it are no longer Restrained.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Supporter / Advanced Supporter Skills</p>",
    "rawSource": "| Electrowebbing\t| 40\t| 20\t| Automatic\t| Action\t| Choose a point you can see within 30 feet; all Creatures within 10 feet of that point must make a Dexterity Saving Throw against your Martial DC or Spell Save DC (your choice). On a failed Save, they take 4d6 Lightning Damage and are Restrained. On a successful Save, a Creature takes half as much Damage and is not Restrained. As an Action, A Creature Restrained in this way may make an Athletics or Acrobatics Check (Escape DC = DC of the initial Saving Throw), ending the condition on a success. A Creature Restrained in this way takes 2d6 Lightning Damage at the end of their Turn.\tWhen this Skill ends, all Creatures Restrained by it are no longer Restrained. | 4 Rounds"
