      "activation": "Reaction",
      "duration": "5 Rounds",
      "effect": "When a Creature within 100 feet of you that you can see takes Damage while it has less than 50% of its maximum Hit Points, you can apply an Omen of Defeat to that Creature. When a Creature with an Omen of Defeat takes Damage, they take additional Psychic Damage equal to your Proficiency Bonus. A Creature affected by Omen of Defeat can make a Charisma Saving Throw against your Spell Save DC at the end of each of their Turns, removing the Omen of Defeat on a success. A Creature can only be affected by one Omen of Defeat at a time.",
