    "content": "<h5>Omen of Defeat</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 30<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 25<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Reaction<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 5 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">When a Creature within 100 feet of you that you can see takes Damage while it has less than 50% of its maximum Hit Points, you can apply an Omen of Defeat to that Creature. When a Creature with an Omen of Defeat takes Damage, they take additional Psychic Damage equal to your Proficiency Bonus. A Creature affected by Omen of Defeat can make a Charisma Saving Throw against your Spell Save DC at the end of each of their Turns, removing the Omen of Defeat on a success. A Creature can only be affected by one Omen of Defeat at a time.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Supporter / Advanced Supporter Skills</p>",
    "rawSource": "| Omen of Defeat\t| 30\t| 25\t| Automatic\t| Reaction |\tWhen a Creature within 100 feet of you that you can see takes Damage while it has less than 50% of its maximum Hit Points, you can apply an Omen of Defeat to that Creature. When a Creature with an Omen of Defeat takes Damage, they take additional Psychic Damage equal to your Proficiency Bonus. A Creature affected by Omen of Defeat can make a Charisma Saving Throw against your Spell Save DC at the end of each of their Turns, removing the Omen of Defeat on a success. A Creature can only be affected by one Omen of Defeat at a time.\t| 5 Rounds"
