    "content": "<h5>Weighted Particles</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 35<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 15<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">When you use this Operator Skill, and as an Action on each of your Turns for the duration, you can make up to three Ranged Spell Attacks against different Creatures you can see within 60 feet. On a Hit, a Creature takes 1d8 Force Damage, and has its Speed reduced by one roll of your Aid Die, rounded to the nearest 5, until the beginning of your next Turn.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Supporter / Advanced Supporter Skills Continued</p>",
