    "content": "<h5>Zero Burst</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 40<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 20<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> Instant</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You create a torrent of freezing air in a cylinder with a 10 foot radius and 60 foot height, centred on a location you can see within range. All Creatures within the area must make a Constitution Saving Throw against your Spell Save DC. On a failed Save, they take 6d8 Cold Damage and suffer the Frozen Condition. A Frozen Creature may reattempt the Saving Throw at the end of each of their Turns, ending the Condition on a success. On a successful Save, they take half as much Damage, and are not Frozen.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Supporter / Advanced Supporter Skills Continued</p>",
