    "content": "<h5>Impulse Signal</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 30<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 15<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 2 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You create a zone of amplification in a 20-foot-radius sphere centred on a location you can see within 100 feet. When you create this zone, choose an Arts Damage Type. When a Creature takes Damage of the chosen Type while within that area, it takes additional Damage of that type equal to one roll of your Aid Die. Once a Creature has taken this additional Damage, it cannot take it again until the beginning of your next Turn. You can expend an Action during your Turn to extend the duration of this Operator Skill by 1 Round, up to a maximum of 5 Rounds; when you do so, you may also move the sphere to a different location you can see within 100 feet.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Supporter / Advanced Supporter Skills Continued</p>",
