    "content": "<h5>Coiling Dragons</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 80<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 35<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 5 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Your Constructs are fitted with the ability to temporarily immobilize their foe. For the duration, when a Construct you have created hits a Creature with an Attack, that Creature must succeed on a Dexterity Saving Throw against your Martial DC or Spell Save DC (your choice) or have its Speed reduced to 0 until the beginning of your next Turn. Once a Creature has made this Saving Throw, it does not need to make it again until the end of your next Turn.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Supporter / Elite Supporter Skills</p>",
