    "content": "<h5>Gravitic Warp</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 80<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 40<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 4 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You create a 20-foot-radius sphere of spatial manipulation Arts centred on a point you can see. For the duration, when a Creature would move while within the area, they must make an Intelligence Saving Throw against your Martial DC. On a failed Save, they take 6d6 Force Damage, and their Speed is reduced to 0 until the beginning of their next Turn. On a successful Save, they take half as much Damage, and their Speed is halved until the beginning of their next Turn.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Supporter / Elite Supporter Skills</p>",
