    "content": "<h5>Mystical Haze</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 80<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 40<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">When you activate this Operator Skill, and as an Action on each of your subsequent Turns for the duration, you release a strange haze in a 30 foot sphere centred on you that confounds your enemies and empowers your allies. Hostile Creatures within the area must succeed on an Intelligence Saving Throw against your Spell Save or Martial DC (your choice) or have their Speed reduced to 0 until the beginning of your next Turn. Allied Creatures within the area recover Hit Points equal to one roll of your Aid Die.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Supporter / Elite Supporter Skills</p>",
