    "content": "<h5>Phase Lock</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 65<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 30<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Offensive<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You alter the flow of time around a Creature you can see within 30 feet, speeding them up. When that Creature takes the Attack Action, they may make an additional Attack as part of that Action. Additionally, when they cast a Cantrip with a Casting Time of 1 Action, they may cast that Cantrip again this Turn as a Bonus Action.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Supporter / Elite Supporter Skills</p>",
