    "content": "<h5>Touch the Heavens</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 50<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 30<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 1 Round</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">The next Art you cast this Turn that has a Range of 10 feet or more has its Range multiplied by 10. If the Spell affects a Line or Cone Area of Effect, the length of those areas is doubled.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Supporter / Elite Supporter Skills</p>",
    "rawSource": "| Touch the Heavens\t| 50\t| 30\t| Automatic\t| Bonus Action\t| The next Art you cast this Turn that has a Range of 10 feet or more has its Range multiplied by 10. If the Spell affects a Line or Cone Area of Effect, the length of those areas is doubled.\t| 1 Round"
