    "level": null,
    "systemData": {},
    "content": "<h5>AEGIS System</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Effect:</strong> This Automaton possess a powerful Originium Arts inhibiting barrier; Creatures within a 10 foot radius sphere centred on this Automaton have Advantage on Saving Throws against Arts that originate from outside of this radius.</p>\n<h3>Rule context</h3>\n<h4>4th Level: Heavy Duty Upgrades</h4>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Refining of your craft has allowed you to produce upgraded versions of the typical Automatons. You gain the following benefits:</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Basic Personality Matrix.</strong> You can instill a rudimentary sentience whenever you create a new custom Automaton, or as a Short Rest Activity with a pre-existing custom Automaton. It can speak, understands that it is artificial, and is unwaveringly loyal to you. When you instil sentience, roll a d6 on the following table to determine its personality:</p>\n<h5>Machine Personality</h5>\n<div class=\"ak5e-source-table-wrap\"><table class=\"ak5e-source-table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Roll</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Personality</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">1</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Taciturn</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">2</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Caring</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">3</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Excitable</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">4</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Warlike</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">5</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Nervous</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">6</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Analytic</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Loaded for Bear.</strong> When you create a new custom Automaton, or use your Fort Builder Feature, you may apply one of the Upgrades, detailed below, based on whether you create a Automaton or Portable Cover.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Additionally, as a Long Rest Activity, you can install one Upgrade onto each of your Automatons; the maximum number of Upgrades an Automaton can have is two.</p>\n<aside class=\"ak5e-note\">\n<h5>Artificer DC</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Some of the Heavy Duty Upgrades call for your Artificer DC; this is calculated as 8 + your Intelligence Modifier + your Proficiency Bonus. Additionally, when you would use your Martial DC, you can use your Artificer DC instead.</p>\n</aside>",
    "rawSource": "##### AEGIS System\n**Effect:** This Automaton possess a powerful Originium Arts inhibiting barrier; Creatures within a 10 foot radius sphere centred on this Automaton have Advantage on Saving Throws against Arts that originate from outside of this radius.",
    "contentVersion": "0.3.8",
    "previousContentHash": "337a1186d54a9806a3fdfc46f4f233698299aede36b823c450f949254c348bbc",
