    "rawSource": "#### 13th Level: Emergency Improv\nAs an Action during your Turn, while you have an Instrument you are Proficient with equipped, you can quickly try to come up with a Performance on the spot; make a DC17 Performance Check, as if you were using the Improvise a Tune Proficient Use of your Instrument. If you succeed, you may either:\n- Immediately expend and roll one of your Aid Die, gaining Muse equal to the amount rolled, and Compose a Performance using that Muse. This Performance is lost if you do not begin Performing it within a minute of Composing it. \n- Immediately expend and roll one of your Aid Die, gaining Muse equal to the amount rolled, and insert an Art into your current Performance at any point with Muse cost equal to or less than Muse you gained.\n\n{{align-text:left\nOnce you have used this Feature, you may not do so again until you have completed a Long Rest.\n}}"
