    "id": "subclass-feature-supporter-summoner-summoner-features-1553",
    "kind": "subclass-feature",
    "name": "Summoner: Summoner Features",
    "parentClass": "Supporter",
    "parentBranch": "Summoner",
    "sourceHeading": "Summoner Features",
    "itemType": "feat",
    "level": null,
    "systemData": {},
    "content": "<h5>Summoner Features</h5>\n<div class=\"ak5e-source-table-wrap\"><table class=\"ak5e-source-table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Level</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Maximum Art Level</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Arts Points</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Sparks of Creation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">1st</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">1</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">3</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">3</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">2nd</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">1</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">3</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">3</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">3rd</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">1</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">4</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">4</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">4th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">1</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">4</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">4</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">5th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">2</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">6</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">5</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">6th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">2</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">6</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">5</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">7th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">2</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">7</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">6</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">8th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">2</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">7</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">6</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">9th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">3</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">10</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">7</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">10th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">3</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">10</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">7</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">11th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">3</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">11</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">8</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">12th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">3</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">11</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">8</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">13th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">4</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">12</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">9</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">14th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">4</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">12</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">9</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">15th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">4</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">15</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">10</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">16th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">4</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">15</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">10</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">17th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">5</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">16</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">11</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">18th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">5</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">16</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">11</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">19th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">5</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">17</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">12</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">20th</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">5</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">17</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">12</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Summoner Arts Pools.</em></strong> When you gain this Feature, choose one of the Standard Arts Pools available to the Caster Class; you learn all of the Arts of 5th Level or less from those Pools, in addition to any Cantrips from those Pools. These Arts are always Prepared. At 11th Level, you may choose an additional Standard Arts Pool.</p>",
    "rawSource": "##### Summoner Features\n| Level | Maximum Art Level | Arts Points | Sparks of Creation |\n|:-----:|:-----------------:|:-----------:|:------------------:|\n| 1st   |         1        |      3      |        3\n| 2nd   |         1        |      3      |        3\n| 3rd   |         1        |      4      |        4\n| 4th   |         1        |      4      |        4\n| 5th   |         2        |      6      |        5\n| 6th   |         2        |      6      |        5\n| 7th   |         2        |      7      |        6\n| 8th   |         2        |      7      |        6\n| 9th   |         3        |      10     |        7\n| 10th  |         3        |      10     |        7\n| 11th  |         3        |      11     |        8\n| 12th  |         3        |      11     |        8\n| 13th  |         4        |      12     |        9\n| 14th  |         4        |      12     |        9\n| 15th  |         4        |      15     |        10\n| 16th  |         4        |      15     |        10\n| 17th  |         5        |      16     |        11\n| 18th  |         5        |      16     |        11\n| 19th  |         5        |      17     |        12\n| 20th  |         5        |      17     |        12\n\n}}\n\n***Summoner Arts Pools.*** When you gain this Feature, choose one of the Standard Arts Pools available to the Caster Class; you learn all of the Arts of 5th Level or less from those Pools, in addition to any Cantrips from those Pools. These Arts are always Prepared. At 11th Level, you may choose an additional Standard Arts Pool.\n}}\n\n\\page\n{{pageNumber,auto}}\n\n{{wide"
