    "rawSource": "#### Proficiencies\n**Armor:** Light Armour, Light Shields<br>\n**Weapons:** Light Melee<br>\n**Tools:** Messenger Kit<br>\n**Saving Throws:** Dexterity + one of your choice from the following: Strength, Charisma <br>\n**Skills:** Three from: Acrobatics, Athletics, Perception, Persuasion, Stealth, Wilderness"
