    "sourceHeading": "11th Level: Uncanny Dodge",
    "itemType": "feat",
    "level": 11,
    "systemData": {},
    "content": "<h4>11th Level: Uncanny Dodge</h4>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">When a Creature that you can see hits you with an Attack, you can use your Reaction to halve that Attack's Damage against you, rounding down.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### 11th Level: Uncanny Dodge\nWhen a Creature that you can see hits you with an Attack, you can use your Reaction to halve that Attack's Damage against you, rounding down."
