    "content": "<h5>Leading Lance</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 10<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 10<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Offensive<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> Instant</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">As part of this Action, make a Melee Weapon Attack against a Creature within your Reach. If it hits, that Attack deals an additional die of Damage. If that Attack reduces a Creature to 0 Hit Points, you can immediately use your Tip of the Spear Feature (no Action required) twice, and you gain 10 Skill Points.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Vanguard / Basic Vanguard Skills</p>",
