    "content": "<h5>Drunken Blade Dance</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 35<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 10<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Offensive<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">For the duration, whenever you take the Attack Action, you may make an additional Melee Attack as part of that Action. In addition, the Critical Range of Melee Attacks you make while this Skill is Active is increased by 1. However, your Armour Class is reduced by 5.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Vanguard / Advanced Vanguard Skills</p>",
