    "content": "<h5>Skullbreaker</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 40<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 10<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">For the duration, Attacks you make that can deal Bludgeoning Damage have +4 Critical Range. However, when you score a Critical Hit with these Attacks, they deal no additional Damage; instead, the damaged Creature must succeed on a Constitution Saving Throw against your Martial DC or be Stunned until the end of their next Turn.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Vanguard / Advanced Vanguard Skills</p>",
