    "content": "<h5>Flicker</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 65<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 35<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> Instant</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Choose a Creature you can see within 30 feet; that Creature must make a Dexterity Saving Throw against your Martial DC as your weapon flashes towards them in a blur. On a failed Save, they take six Hits from one weapon you are wielding. On a successful save, they take only three Hits. If the Creature is an Elite or Leader, they take six hits regardless of if they pass or fail, and you gain a barrier that completely negates the next Damage you would take from that Creature.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Vanguard / Elite Vanguard Skills</p>",
