      "cost": 80,
      "start": 50,
      "methods": [
        "automatic"
      ],
      "activation": "Bonus Action",
      "duration": "3 Rounds",
      "effect": "The shadows around you strike along aside you, before reclaiming you into them. When you take the Attack Action, you may make three additional Attacks as part of this Action; the amount of additional Attacks you can make decreases by 1 at the beginning of each of your Turns. If you score a Critical Hit, that Creature becomes Dazed until the end of their next Turn. When this Skill ends, if you have reduced a Creature to 0 Hit Points, you become Invisible for 1 minute, or until you make an Attack. You can end this Skill early during your Turn, no Action required.",
