    "content": "<h5>The Fox's Prey</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 80<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 50<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Automatic<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Bonus Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Rounds</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">The shadows around you strike along aside you, before reclaiming you into them. When you take the Attack Action, you may make three additional Attacks as part of this Action; the amount of additional Attacks you can make decreases by 1 at the beginning of each of your Turns. If you score a Critical Hit, that Creature becomes Dazed until the end of their next Turn. When this Skill ends, if you have reduced a Creature to 0 Hit Points, you become Invisible for 1 minute, or until you make an Attack. You can end this Skill early during your Turn, no Action required.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Vanguard / Elite Vanguard Skills</p>",
