    "content": "<h5>Last Breath</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>SP Cost:</strong> 80<br><br><strong>Start SP:</strong> 35<br><br><strong>Charging:</strong> Offensive<br><br><strong>Activation:</strong> Action<br><br><strong>Duration:</strong> Instant</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Choose a Creature within 60-feet that you can see. You teleport to a location within 5-feet of that Creature; they then must make a Constitution Saving Throw against your Martial DC, taking 8d12 Slashing Damage on a failed Save, or half as much on a successful one. If this Damage reduces the Creature to less than 50 Hit Points, they die.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Source:</strong> AK5e 1st Edition v1.3.1, Chapter 3: Vanguard / Elite Vanguard Skills</p>",
