    "rawSource": "#### 1st Level: Strike from the Shadows\nYour training has given you a speciality with a particular set of tactics. You gain the following benefits:\n\n**Quicklaunch.** When you make an Attack Roll using a Weapon with the Thrown Property, you may Draw a different Weapon with the Thrown Property as part of that Attack. \n\n**Shadowstrike.** When you take the Attack Action while you have the Invisible Condition, you gain the following benefits until the end of the Turn:\n- You may make 1 additional Attack as part of that Attack Action.\n- When you hit with an Attack, you may use your Tip of the Spear Feature (no Action required)."
