    "content": "<h4>17th Level: Breakthrough Skill</h4>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You gain an additional Elite Operator Skill; you may choose from any Elite Operator Skill available to the Guard Class, Defender Class, Marksman Class, Specialist Class, or Vanguard Class. However, ignore the Charging Method for that Skill. When you complete a Long Rest, you may exchange this Operator Skill for a different Elite Operator Skill from one of those classes.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### 17th Level: Breakthrough Skill\nYou gain an additional Elite Operator Skill; you may choose from any Elite Operator Skill available to the Guard Class, Defender Class, Marksman Class, Specialist Class, or Vanguard Class. However, ignore the Charging Method for that Skill. When you complete a Long Rest, you may exchange this Operator Skill for a different Elite Operator Skill from one of those classes.\n\n{{imageMaskEdge1,--offset:2%,--rotation:90\n<img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/2/26/Saga_Elite_2.png?a778b8&20230927021731' \n  style='position:absolute;top:140px;right:-140px;width:1100px;clip-path:rect(auto 51% auto auto);' />\n}}\n\n{{imageMaskEdge1,--offset:4%,--rotation:0\n<img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/2/26/Saga_Elite_2.png?a778b8&20230927021731' \n  style='position:absolute;top:140px;right:-140px;width:1100px;clip-path:rect(37% auto auto auto);' />\n}}\n\n\n\\page\n{{pageNumber,auto}}"
