    "rawSource": "##### Equipment Exchange\nWhen you choose this Branch, you may exchange 1x Light Melee Weapon or 1x Light Shield from your Starting Equipment for 1x Heavy Melee Weapon.\n}}\n\n{{imageMaskCorner23,--offsetX:-47%,--offsetY:-34%,--rotation:0\n<img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/1/12/Vulpisfoglia_Elite_2.png?20241103015802' \n  style='position:absolute;top:00px;right:0px;width:1300px;clip-path:rect(31.5% 69.5% auto auto);' />\n}}\n\n{{imageMaskEdge1,--offset:21%,--rotation:0\n<img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/1/12/Vulpisfoglia_Elite_2.png?20241103015802' \n  style='position:absolute;top:00px;right:0px;width:1300px;clip-path:rect(auto auto auto auto);' />\n}}\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\\column"
