    "content": "<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Basic Guard Talents</p>\n<div class=\"ak5e-source-table-wrap\"><table class=\"ak5e-source-table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Name</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Effect</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Module Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">In War’s Shadow</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">Once per Turn, when a Creature you can see hits another Creature within 10ft of you with an Attack Roll, you can use your Reaction to halve the Attack's Damage against that Creature. However, if you do, you take the same amount of Damage.</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">You can now also use this Feature when another Creature within 10ft of you would make a Saving Throw against an effect you can see. Damage that Creature would take as a result of that Saving Throw is halved, but you take the same amount of Damage.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h3>Rule context</h3>\n<h4>3rd Level: Basic Talent</h4>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You gain a Basic Talent of your choice from the Basic Guard Talent table. When you reach 8th Level, you may either pick a different Basic Talent to gain, or upgrade your Basic Talent, gaining its Module Effect.</p>",
