      "#### 1st Level: Instruction\nYou are talented in leading or training fighters of any stripe. You learn Instructions that are fuelled by special dice called Instruction Dice, detailed below under Instruction Options.  \n<br>\n**Instructions:** When you use the Help Action, you may also issue one Instruction to the same Creature you helped. Each Instruction expends 1 Instruction Die.\n:\n**Instruction Dice:** You have four Instruction Dice, which are d6s; you regain all expended Instruction Dice when you finish a Short or Long Rest. \n:\nYou gain an additional Instruction Die when you reach Guard Levels 7 (five dice total) and 14 (six dice total).\n\n<img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/c/c1/Whislash.png' \n  style='position:absolute;top:620px;right:500px;width:150px' />\n\n\\column",
