    "classOption": {
      "category": "instruction",
      "effect": "That Creature may immediately move a distance equal to three rolls of your Instruction Die, rounded to the nearest 5. This movement does not provoke Opportunity Attacks from Creatures they were within the Reach of when they began this movement."
    },
    "ruleContext": "#### 1st Level: Instruction\nYou are talented in leading or training fighters of any stripe. You learn Instructions that are fuelled by special dice called Instruction Dice, detailed below under Instruction Options.  \n<br>\n**Instructions:** When you use the Help Action, you may also issue one Instruction to the same Creature you helped. Each Instruction expends 1 Instruction Die.\n:\n**Instruction Dice:** You have four Instruction Dice, which are d6s; you regain all expended Instruction Dice when you finish a Short or Long Rest. \n:\nYou gain an additional Instruction Die when you reach Guard Levels 7 (five dice total) and 14 (six dice total).\n\n<img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/c/c1/Whislash.png' \n  style='position:absolute;top:620px;right:500px;width:150px' />\n\n\\column\n\n#### 10th Level: Kingmaker\nOnce per Turn, when you issue an Instruction, you may choose a second allied Creature within 30 feet of you and issue the same Instruction to them. This additional Instruction does not expend an Instruction Die; however, your Instruction Die is always a d6 for this second Instruction.\n\n#### 13th Level: Superior Instruction\nYou lead from the front, and have become a renowned leader. You gain the following benefits:\n\n**Improved Instruction Dice.** Your Instruction Dice become d10s. \n\n**Renowned Instructor.** When you roll Initiative and have less than half of your maximum Instruction Dice remaining, you regain Instruction Dice until you have half (rounding up) remaining.\n\n#### Instruction Options\nThe Instructions available to the Instructor Branch are listed in alphabetical order.\n:",
    "contentVersion": "0.3.8",
    "content": "<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Get out of there!</strong> <br><br>That Creature may immediately move a distance equal to three rolls of your Instruction Die, rounded to the nearest 5. This movement does not provoke Opportunity Attacks from Creatures they were within the Reach of when they began this movement.</p>\n<h3>Rule context</h3>\n<h4>1st Level: Instruction</h4>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You are talented in leading or training fighters of any stripe. You learn Instructions that are fuelled by special dice called Instruction Dice, detailed below under Instruction Options.<br><br><br><strong>Instructions:</strong> When you use the Help Action, you may also issue one Instruction to the same Creature you helped. Each Instruction expends 1 Instruction Die.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Instruction Dice:</strong> You have four Instruction Dice, which are d6s; you regain all expended Instruction Dice when you finish a Short or Long Rest.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You gain an additional Instruction Die when you reach Guard Levels 7 (five dice total) and 14 (six dice total).</p>\n<h4>10th Level: Kingmaker</h4>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Once per Turn, when you issue an Instruction, you may choose a second allied Creature within 30 feet of you and issue the same Instruction to them. This additional Instruction does not expend an Instruction Die; however, your Instruction Die is always a d6 for this second Instruction.</p>\n<h4>13th Level: Superior Instruction</h4>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You lead from the front, and have become a renowned leader. You gain the following benefits:</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Improved Instruction Dice.</strong> Your Instruction Dice become d10s.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Renowned Instructor.</strong> When you roll Initiative and have less than half of your maximum Instruction Dice remaining, you regain Instruction Dice until you have half (rounding up) remaining.</p>\n<h4>Instruction Options</h4>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">The Instructions available to the Instructor Branch are listed in alphabetical order.</p>",
    "rawSource": "**Get out of there!** <br>\nThat Creature may immediately move a distance equal to three rolls of your Instruction Die, rounded to the nearest 5. This movement does not provoke Opportunity Attacks from Creatures they were within the Reach of when they began this movement. \n:",
