      "| Name          |Effect|Module Effect|",
      "|:-------------:|:----:|:-----------:|",
      "#### 3rd Level: Basic Talent\nYou gain a Basic Talent of your choice from the Basic Specialist Talents table. When you reach 8th Level, you may either pick a different Basic Talent to gain, or upgrade your Basic Talent, gaining its Module Effect."
