    "optionRawSource": "| Beneath Me\t| Once per Turn, when you make an Attack against a Creature that is a smaller Size Category than you, you can give yourself Advantage on that Attack Roll.\t| If you give yourself Advantage in this way, and the Attack hits, it deals additional Damage equal to your Proficiency Bonus.",
