      "effect": "The first time each Turn you hit a Creature with an Attack, that Attack deals additional Acid Damage equal to one roll of your Aid Die. Additionally, when you inflict the Corroded Condition on a Creature, they  lose all Resistances to Physical Damage for the next instance of Damage they suffer.",
      "ritualType": "Permanent",
