    "optionRawSource": "| Night Watchman\t| As an Action, you can place a Shadow Sentry for 1 hour at a point within 10 feet of you. A Shadow Sentry is an invisible, intangible Arts Construct that cannot move or take any Actions. When a Creature moves within 10 feet of the Sentry, you are alerted to that movement, even if the Creature is Invisible or you are asleep. Once you have used this Feature, you may not do so again until you have completed a Long Rest.\t| When you have been alerted to a Creature by your Shadow Sentry, you know the location of that Creature for the next minute.",
